689	Speedway Stout - Velvet 2017	5186	Imperial Stout	13.0	\N	AleSmith and Urge Gastropub have once again joined together to create this highly sought-after version of Speedway Stout to celebrate Urge’s 7th Anniversary. This year’s brew has ben aged in 60-year-old sherry, 24-year-old Central American rum, and 23-year-old Evan Williams barrels, then infused with Madagascar vanilla beans and locally-roasted Jamaica Blue Mountain and Kopi Luwak cold brew from Mostra Coffee. The result is a truly collaborative beer that combines notes of oak, fruit, vanilla, and burnt sugar with a strong chocolate and roasted malt backbone. Let the celebration begin!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-21 23:19:19.935662	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
