3046	24 Carrot Golden Ale	5211	Spiced Beer	8.5	\N	Winner of Stone’s 2015 American Homebrewers Association competition. Brewed in collaboration with Juli Goldenberg & Monkey Paw Pub & Brewery. A carrot cake-inspired Belgian-style ale brewed with carrots, cinnamon, raisins & vanilla bean.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.732745	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
3050	Old Guardian - Extra Hoppy	5211	Barley Wine	11.0	\N	Barley wines are traditionally hefty brews, but ours is downright excessive. The huge maltiness of this beer is only tamed by an equally prodigious addition of hops, creating a rich, slightly sweet, caramel-hued ale infused with assertive bitterness and bright hop notes, all culminating in a pleasing dryness. While it will evolve into an even more glorious brew with age, this beer’s delicious onslaught of flavors will seriously challenge your ability to wait any longer to drink it.http://www.stonebrewing.com/og/odd/	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.732745	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
3052	Sawyers Triple	5211	Tripel	7.6	\N	Sawyer’s Triple is based upon the traditional 'Golden Triple' style of strong ale, hailing from Belgium, and weighs in at 7.6% alc/vol. The brew is deep golden in color with a distinctive spicy, sweet and hoppy nose. Effervescent carbonation leads to a modestly dry malt character with hoppy flavors and alcohol overtones. Sawyer’s Triple was formulated and brewed by Bill Sherwood.[Note: this beer doesn’t have Stone in front of the name by explicit request from the brewer.]	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.732745	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
3067	Cerere	219	Hefeweizen	5.5	\N	Il nostro personale omaggio alla Sicilia, terra delle messi. Birra ispirata alle Weiss Tedesche. Caratterizzata da un’abbondante schiuma compatta, dal classico bouquet speziato e fruttato e dal colore giallo paglierino velato dovuto alla presenza dei caratteristici lieviti. Facile da bere ed estremamente rinfrescante.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.732745	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
3068	Medusa	219	Dubbel	8.0	\N	Birra ispirata allo stile trappista Dubbel. Dal colore bruno con schiuma color cappuccino. Caratterizzata da un ricco aroma di malto vivacizzato da una speziatura che alleggerisce la bevuta. Il gusto è complesso e caloroso ma il suo finale inaspettatamente secco facilita la bevuta. Al naso emergono note di frutta sotto spirito, confettura e caramello.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.732745	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
3071	/ Brauhaus Pfaffenhofen Urbanus La 1902	220	Dortmunder	4.9	\N	Chi non ha mai visto una partita di calcio sorseggiando una birra fresca? La 1902 è la Birra Ufficiale della nostra squadra. La birra dedicata a tutti i tifosi del Lane. Birra e calcio costituiscono da sempre un connubio di autentica e genuina passione. La stessa che ci abbiamo messo per produrre questa speciale bionda. Ognuno ha il suo modo di vivere e tifare Vicenza, e tu come lo fai? Ogni momento può essere quello giusto. Raccontaci i tuoi momenti accompagnati da La 1902. Cento per cento passione biancorossa.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.732745	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
