4065	/ Precarious Souastern Hospitality	5220	Imperial Stout	10.2	\N	Collabv with Precarious Beer Project. We had the distinct privilege of hosting internationally renowned Brew Gods The Answer as our first in-house collaboration. Knowing their penchant for silky, intense stouts and our love for the darkness, an imperial stout made a lot of sense. We put together a unique blend of fresh sage, vanilla paste, our favorite locally made hickory syrup, and a touch of harissa spice blend on top of a rich base of German Vienna malt, with British caramel and roasted specialty malts, and oats. The result is pure milk chocolate with a touch of menthol from the sage and hickory syrup. We are very proud to put our name next to The Answer on this beer.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.111027	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
