3757	Rocksteady	5218	Sidro	5.5	\N	Welsh microbrewer, Tiny Rebel, has teamed up with artisan cider maker, Hogan’s Cider, to make the first ever collaborative cider between a Welsh brewer and an English cider producer.Hogan’s Cider and Tiny Rebel will produce a 5.5% hard cider called Rocksteady which will be available to buy from Monday 17th March and will be the first in a range of ciders that the two business are looking to create.Warwickshire-based Hogan’s Cider, has been making premium quality cider since 2005 when Allen Hogan turned his 25 year cider making hobby into a full time business. Hogan’s multi award winning cider is fermented from 100% fresh pressed English cider apple juice from the three counties of Herefordshire, Worcestershire and Gloucestershire, it is this cider that will be used to create the unique Rocksteady blend.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.915778	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
