4734	Doce Amencer & Gerookte Zonsondergang	5229	Smoked	9.5	\N	Good morning! Last June we brewed a collab with our Spanish friends from in Peccatum. A hoppy sour, fermented with our house culture of a lactobacillus. Then we split the batch in 3 barrels and dryhopped each barrel with a different hop. The beer is called Zure dageraad & Na noite frotial. This translates to sour sunrise in the fruity evening. The beers will be presented at Brewda 2016!A month later we brewed a Smoked Barleywine on the installation of In Peccatum, called Doce amencer & gerookte zonsondergang. This beer will also be available at Brewda. Exciting stuff!!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.288158	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
