4896	10Th Anniversary Barrel Aged Barley Wine	262	Barley Wine	12.5	\N	Raise a toast with everyone at Fort George as we celebrate our 10th anniversary. The brewery has put together this special Sweet Virginia Series barleywine to commemorate the occasion. A strong barley base balanced with heaping hop additions, all carefully aged in Adelsheim and Argyle Pinot Noir barrels in the windows of the Lovell Showroom. With a barleywine this strong, it will get better and better with age – just like Fort George.Brewer’s NotesThe Sweet Virginia Series is a brewer-developed small-batch project focusing on rare and barrel aged beers, typically released once a month at the brewery. Occasionally, as the project allows, a limited amount may be available at a bottle shop or pub near you. Fort George is distributed only in the Pacific Northwest.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.288158	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
