5111	18Th Street Brotherhood Belgian Style Patersbier	5231	Belgian Ale	4.5	\N	In the year of our lord 1675, there lived St. Citrus, known throughout all the land for his fresh flavor and harmony. Lo a Brotherhood was formed by those who carried his mantle and out Patersbier, a tradtional Belgian style ale, brewed to be 'offered to the brothers on festive occasions'. mark’s the celebratory collaboration between Pipeworks and 18th St. Brewery. Brewed with fresh citrus zest, Brotherhood is a tribute to the beautiful, delicious harmony of the Brotherhood of Brewers!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.485546	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
5126	/ Interboro Panther Like A Panther	5231	Porter	7.5	\N	The Panther Like a Panther Stout follows RTJ’s 2017 craft beer debut: their hop-heavy Stay Gold IPA. Unlike their last beer endeavor, which featured a single recipe for the multiple brewers involved, Panther Like a Panther is using three distinct recipes, crafted by each individual brewing partner. Interboro, for instance, is said to be making a traditional stout while Pipeworks is brewing a porter blended with a bourbon barrel-aged beer. J. Wakefield, on the other hand, is said to be brewing a coffee-infused stout with beans courtesy of Miami’s Panther Coffee. Artwork for the beer label was created by legendary artist Jermaine Rogers, known for his posters for David Bowie, The Beastie Boys, Melvins, Radiohead, Foo Fighters and many more.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.485546	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
4941	Quiet Rye-It Rye Pale	262	Specialty Grain	6.1	\N	Rye has been used in beers for centuries for its delicious and unique spicy characteristic. We combined the distinct taste of rye with the new “Zythos” hop from Hop Union. The Zythos hop has qualities that are similar to Simcoe and Citra hops that give off a distinct citrus and pine taste. With the Zythos hops delicately providing your taste buds with a well-balanced bitterness, the rye malt sweeps the tongue with its distinct spices that soothes the soul. Come on, experience the hops, let’s go crazy, and get your kicks with this delicious pale ale from the Fort George Brewery.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.288158	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
4965	Birra Agricola Weizen	264	Blanche	0.0	\N	La birra agricola weizen di Buenavista Cerveza Agricola, non pastorizzata e non filtrata, ha un aroma erbaceo, fruttato e dà una forte sensazione di freschezza; il colore dorato presenta la tipica opalescenza della weiss tipica del malto di frumento. Il gusto è morbido e mielato con note di banana; a tavola può sostituire egregiamente il vino bianco, magari con le bollicine. La schiuma è soffice e persistente. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d'orzo, malto di frumento, luppolo, lievito, zucchero.Buenavista Cerveza Agricola's unpasteurized and unfiltered agriculturist beer has a herbaceous, fruity aroma and gives a strong feeling of freshness; the golden color has the typical opalescence of the weiss itself of wheat malt. The taste is soft and mild with banana notes; at table it may well replace white wine, perhaps with bubbles. The foam is soft and persistent. Ingredients: water, barley malt, wheat malt, hops, yeast, sugar.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.288158	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
