5795	Rosco & Enos	5237	Porter	6.1	\N	Sometimes the boys get arrested on trumped up charges. Happens to the best of us. And now the Sheriff can take the General Lee out for a spin. This smoked porter is built on the foundations of Bo&Luke but takes a different turn. Much lighter and more sessionable, this smoked porter actually gets its smoked character from house smoked malt that we smoked with oak staves from barrels formerly holding Bo&Luke. Look for lots of the same flavors you find in Bo&Luke such as chocolate, smoke, caramel, and roast but slightly lighter and without the time spent in a bourbon barrel.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.661028	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
