7199	Creamin' Ale	372	Baltic Porter	8.0	\N	Birra nera ad alta fermentazione, non pastorizzata, rifermentata in bottiglia. Il colore è nero impenetrabile e la schiuma color nocciola è fine e cremosa. Molto corposa ed aromatica, presenta evidenti sentori di caffè e cioccolato. Abbinamenti: molluschi, ostriche, cozze crude, parmigiano reggiano, mozzarella di bufala, taralli speziati. Birra da pub, da bere con gli amici. Leggero deposito di lieviti sul fondo. Temperatura di servizio 8 - 10° C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, frumento, miele d’erica (1 % del prodotto), luppolo, lievito. Top-fermented dark beer, unpasteurized, fermented in the bottle. The color is black impenetrable and hazel foam is fine and creamy. Very full-bodied and aromatic, it has obvious hints of coffee and chocolate. Serve with: shellfish, oysters, raw mussels, parmesan, mozzarella, spicy taralli. Beer pub, to drink with friends. Slight deposit of yeast on the bottom. Serving temperature 8 -10° C. Ingredients: water, barley malt, wheat, heather honey (1% of the product), hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.22296	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
6353	Forêt Noire	333	Oud Bruin	6.8	\N	La Forêt Noire is a reddish-black ale brewed with a mixture of malts (Carafa, Special B) which give it real body and depth - a color and texture reminiscent of chocolate torte. The beer is then blended with cherry wine and fermented cherries, resulting in a dark, roasty beer balanced by the fruity tartness of cherry. A perfect after dinner drink. The beer was named after the famous Black Forest cake: a combination of chocoolate cake and candied cherry. Cheers !	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.839507	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
