6566	Rhaner Pascher-Bier Eulenberg	348	Kellerbier	5.2	\N	' Pascher- Die Nacht der langen Schatten' startete in Schönsee-Friedrichshäng heuer in die 6. Saison. Das als Hommage an die Schmuggler aufgeführte Freilichtspiel hatte am 3. August Premiere. Rechtzeitig dazu haben die Pascher nun auch ihr eigenes Bier: das Pascher-Bier vom Eulenberg. Wir vom Rhanerbräu freuen uns, dass den 'Schönseer Schmugglern' unser untergäriges, naturtrübes und unfiltriertes Kellerbier so gut schmeckt, dass wir daraus das 'Pascher-Bier' machen durften. Ein handwerklich gebrautes Bier-Schmankerl, wie aus der 'guten' alten Zeit!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.026848	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
6530	Goji	343	Fruit Beer	3.5	\N	Birra ambrata, ad alta fermentazione, prodotta con l'aggiunta di bacche fresche di Goji biologico coltivato nella Val di Pejo. La schiuma è fine e compatta, di colore beige chiaro. Alla vista il colore è ambrato con riflessi ramati.Al naso spiccano note fruttate ed erbacee. In bocca è leggera e rinfrescante, con un amaro delicato che lascia affiorare il sapore del Goji. Abbinamenti: aperitivo, primi piatti, insalate, pizze, formaggi freschi. Servire a 6 - 8° C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d'orzo, goji (1%), luppolo, lievito.Amber beer, high fermentation, produced by the addition of fresh organic Goji berries cultivated in the Pejo Valley. The foam is fine and compact, light beige. At the sight the color is amber with copper reflexes. Nose shows fruity and herbaceous notes. In the mouth it is light and refreshing, with a delicate bitterness that leaves Goji flavor to emerge. Matches: aperitif, first courses, salads, pizzas, fresh cheeses. Serve at 6 - 8 ° C. Ingredients: water, barley malt, goji (1%), hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.839507	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
