6605	Pampinella	351	Spiced Beer	4.5	\N	Birra chiara, ad alta fermentazione, non filtrata, non pastorizzata e rifermentata in bottiglia, schiuma bianca e persistente, presenta una gasatura delicata. Colore dorato, sentori intensi di canapa, dati dall’utilizzo di infiorescenze e semi di canapa sativa certificata. Distribuita in collaborazione con Asso Canapa. Contiene glutine. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, luppoli, lievito, zucchero e canapa. Ale, top-fermented, unfiltered, unpasteurized and fermented in the bottle, white foam and persistent, has a delicate carbonation. Golden color, intense aromas of hemp, due to the use of inflorescences and seeds of Cannabis sativa certified. Distributed in collaboration with Asso Canapa - Ace Hemp. Contains gluten. Ingredients: water, barley malt, hops, yeast, sugar and hemp.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.026848	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
