7627	Ohio Unidragon - 2016	5252	Imperial Stout	12.5	\N	William Taft refuses to be dead.  He’d rather roam the Ohio skies on a friendly Unidragon.  Most of the time.  Here, Taft enjoys a view of the Queen City and contemplates, 'Should I go get a jalapeno cheese bratwurst or a very large bowl of chili?...'  This dark imperial stout boasts a 12.5% ABV to celebrate the changes in Ohio’s ABV regulations and is made with rye malt and hops from the Ohio Hop Growers Guild.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
7632	Ride The Wendigo	5252	Scotch Ale / Wee Heavy	11.0	\N	Defended from a notorious clan of Scottish lore, head brewer Dan Lipke channeled the Tartan tapestry encoded in his DNA to create a formidable Wee Heavy. The beer was aged in 10 months in Pierre Ferrand cognac barrels. Excited, our heroine rides a wending through a MN park, killing mutated badgers. Ask yourself, 'Who needs a reason to ride the Wendigo?'	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
