8023	Trail Porter - Raspberry	5256	Sour / Wild Ale	7.0	\N	Trail Porter is a Sour Baltic Porter that was aged for two years in used Rittenhouse Rye Whiskey Barrels and fermented 100% with Brettanomyces. We were able to source local raspberries, and we decided to add them to one of the barrels and left the other barrel unfruited.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
