7158	Oktoberfest 2017	5248	Oktoberfest / Märzen	5.5	\N	A beautifully bright, deep golden coloured beer with fine bubbles, lively carbonation and great lacing topped by a tightly packed white head. The long maturation period has given this beer very clear, well-defined flavours and aromas. The Vienna & Munich malts give this beer a real substantial malt backbone of bread & toast, which is slightly offset by the sharper flavour of the Pilsner malt. The Tettnang hop imparts a great classically noble, delicately spicy flavour that gives this beer more complexity than the traditional German interpretations. Overall Oktoberfest 2017 is a rich, malty lager with bright hoppy notes.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.22296	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
