7924	Lariun	392	Fruit Beer	6.0	\N	Lariùň, birra ai mirtilli prodotta e imbottigliata sotto il Monte Rosa. Birra alla frutta di ispirazione belga, dal colore violaceo e dalla schiuma con riflessi rosati dati dall'utilizzo dei mirtilli delle nostre montagne raccolti accuratamente a mano. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d'orzo, fiocchi di mais, frumento, mirtilli, luppolo, lievito, zucchero.Lariùň, blueberry beer brewed and bottled under Monte Rosa. Belgian-inspired fruit beer, with a purplish color and foam with pinkish reflections given by the use of the blueberries of our mountains carefully picked by hand. Ingredients: water, barley malt, corn flakes, wheat, blueberries, hops, yeast, sugar.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
7926	Saison Du Blé	5256	Saison	6.0	\N	Saison du Blé is the harmony of a fluffy wheat Saison with Brettanomyces and Lactobacillus. The wheat balances a very dry body with a creamy, billowy mouthfeel and our house Saison yeast adds complexity and acidity. This farmhouse ale was aged in Chardonnay barrels for several months.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
7927	Saison Du Fermier	5256	Saison	7.0	\N	Saison du Fermier is a Chardonnay barrel-fermented Saison. It is the harmony of new and old. It is robust and has the paler color of modern Saisons, yet it is balanced with the brightness, depth and rustic character of Brettanomyces and Lactobacillus found in traditional Saisons. This farmhouse ale was fermented in and aged in wine barrels for several months.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
