7933	/ Off Color La Bière De Fantaisie - Blend #1	5256	Saison	7.0	\N	Blend of Puncheon-Fermented Saisons that used the house Saison strain from Off Color Brewing in Chicago and the house Missouri cocktail from Side Project Brewing. Fermented and aged in French Oak Pinot Noir puncheons for 6 months before blending.Fancy Beer (Blend #1) uses Off Color’s saison yeast and Side Project’s wild yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
7935	/ 2Nd Shift Lattice	5256	Saison	6.0	\N	Lattice is a dry-hopped Farmhouse Pale Ale brewed in collaboration with 2nd Shift Brewing in New Haven, Missouri. This farmhouse ale was fermented in French Oak puncheons with our house Saison strain and a soft blend of Brettanomyces strains, dry-hopped with Amarillo and Galaxy hops and naturally conditioned in this bottle.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
