21595	Laiss	791	Hefeweizen	5.0	\N	Birra delicata prodotta con una perfetta miscela di malti d’orzo e frumento, molto dissetante ed adatta ad essere abbinata a molte ricette a base di pasta. Gradazione alcolica 5%, bassa fermentazione. Servire a 5 gradi C, conservare al fresco, al riparo dalla luce ed in posizione verticale. Disponibile in bottiglia (33cl, 75 cl) o in fusti da 30l.Non amara, con intensi profumi di frumento e molto leggera; ottima da accompagnare a fritti di pesce.Delicate beer produced with a perfect mix of barley and wheat malts, very refreshing and suitable to be combined with many recipes with pasta. Alcohol 5%, low brewing. Serve at 6-8 degree C. Store in a cool place, away from light and in vertical position. Available in bottles (33cl, 75 cl) or 30l kegs.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.450619	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
9544	Special Relativity	5271	Imperial Stout	9.5	\N	Special Relativity is a special case of General Relativity, which focuses more on time (and space) as opposed to gravity. To pay homage to this theory, which gave rise to E = mc², we brewed a stout that’s a special case of our stout General Relativity. For Special Relativity 1, we brewed this beer with a healthy dose of oats. This oatmeal stout pours viscous black releasing aromas of creamy chocolate, roasted coffee, oats, toasted marshmallow, vanilla, with a touch of dark fruit out of tan-mousse head. Its flavor fallows the aroma with a full creamy body and an aggressive bitterness to balance the sweet, which maintains its drinkability.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.005964	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
