8374	Super	403	Spiced Beer	6.0	\N	'Super' is the Strong Ale of Trimmutura with long maturation. The hints of Sicilian wild fennel seed, the sustained alcoholic strength and the right balance between malt and bitter sweetness, make it a breeze that delivers the senses in a perfect balance between color, smells and flavors.As soon as it is poured, a fine, persistent foam protects beer from intense color of malt, ramified shades and good turbidity. By approaching the glass on the nose, the presence of the wild fennel sweetened by the caramel and the softness of the alcohol is perceived with delicacy. It is immediately refreshing, thanks to the seed, with a rich but never obtrusive structure of malt, caramel and hops. In the final, clear the delicacy of the hopping that can last for a long time.Trimble beer: 'Beer with Sicily inside'!Gourmet Matching: Great for aperitifs, it is especially tied to red and white meat, cooked to irons, to the plate or better to grilled, and to pure-pork sausages. Try first with dry pasta or baked. Very good with pizza and street food! Recommended glass: pintaService temperature: 5-7 ° CEBC: 31IBU: 31	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.622897	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
