8636	Labs: Saison #331	5262	Saison	6.5	\N	Saison #331 is spiced with grains of paradise, coriander and sweet orange peel to emphasize the yeast characteristics. The YeastSaison flavor characteristics come from the yeast! Our yeast produces a beer that is highly aromatic with clean, citrus-esters, peppery and spicy with no earthiness and low phenols. This strain enhances the use of spices and aroma hops and is extremely attenuative but leaves an unexpected silky, rich mouthfeel in a very dry finished beer.The MaltOur profile is simple, using a combination of traditional French malts and American. Including French Pilsen, French Vienna, American Pale and American Wheat. The HopsWe use a combination of traditional and 'California' style hops. Hallertauer Mitttlefruh (spicy/floral/citrus), Saaz (earthy/herbal/floral) and the new Lemondrop variety (lemon/citrus/ herbal).	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.796861	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
8645	La Carretta	412	Altbier	5.2	\N	La Carretta Birra Artigianale in stile Alt: con questa birra abbiamo voluto omaggiare una delle più antiche e conosciute tradizioni della nostra terra e che ci rappresenta nel mondo. La Carretta è una birra ad alta fermentazione contraddistinta da un lungo periodo di maturazione a bassa temperatura, necessario per rendere un gusto pulito ed equilibrato. Birra che si caratterizza per un intenso colore ramato, seguito da toni tostati e caramellati, bilanciati da un amaro deciso.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.796861	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
