10891	Uncle Zester	5284	Sour / Wild Ale	8.5	\N	A Braggot is a beer brewed with both honey and malt. It’s a beer / mead hybrid sent through time to delight the modern craft beer palate. We first brewed this beer after meeting Brad from B. Nektar and tasting his meads; we knew then this would be something special. Uncle Zester is a sour beer loaded with zest and juice, which perfectly balances the sweetness of the barrel-aged honey. It’s rich, it’s moreish and you’re going to love it.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.562328	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
10894	Sound Wave Aussie	5284	American Pale Ale (APA)	5.6	\N	Bottled; Occasional.Our flagship IPA brimming with Aussie hops.We have taken the base of our regular IPA Sound wave, and carefully chosen an Australian hop to replace each US hop used. Ella, Summer, Galaxy & Vic Secret all sing to a different tune and the effect is stunning, producing a very different beer. Sound Wave Aussie is more citrus than tropical fruit and has a more pronounced resinous finish. a more bitter tribute to our friends down under and their sporting success in the UK this year.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.562328	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
