11627	Collab 07 Curtis / Wheaton / Koch Züper Magik W00Tstout	5292	Imperial Stout	10.0	\N	Since its inception in 2013, w00tstout has been the most awesomely colossal release we brew. For this special version, we knew we needed to make it unique, but we knew regular unique wouldn’t be enough…the challenge was how to make it extra fantastically w00ty unique. Thusly the conundrum: How do you brew a BIGGER, BOLDER version of the biggest thing you make? Our trio was ready to take on this very very real struggle. For humanity. For you. For the sheer weightiness of it all. That’s what heroes do. Collective brainpower produced the idea to go nuts and add almonds and halzelnuts in addition to pecans and use German whiskey barrels.Thus, this libation that has been compared to the equivalent of a Kentucky Derby Pie became the German equivalent to the heretofore uninvented malt & whiskey soaked…errr, MaltNutloaf. So how do you say “MaltNutloaf” in German? The answer is you don’t. Mein Gott, no one should.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.944228	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
