14266	Chocolate Malt Milkshake Breakfast Stout	5319	Milk/Sweet Stout	5.6	\N	G’day Mate! We created our Aussie inspired Chocolate Malt Milkshake Breakfast Stout with our dear friends at Mr. West for their Pints of Origin Canada event during Good Beer Week in Melbourne. We fashioned a sweet stout, with generous amounts of milk lactose sugar. We then added heaps of the Australian favourite ‘Energy Drink’. The result is a chocolate and malt flavour bomb that finishes with a delectably creamy, sweet finish that is still not overly cloying and perfectly drinkable. It’s a real rippa’! (That’s the extent of the Australian slang we know)	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:44.888783	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
