12271	Citoyen Du Monde	5298	Lambic - Fruit	5.0	\N	Brewed for the 20th anniversary of Shelton Brothers, to be served at the 2016 Festival in Louisville, KY. From label; 'The connection between the Cantillon and Shelton families is a lovely story that began two decades ago. Brother Joel was a bassist touring with a show that came to the Cirque Royal in Brussels. He made a chance visit to the brewery and was welcomed warmly by my mother, Claude. Joel fell in love with our lambic immediately, and Dan and Will followed soon after. 1996 was the year of our debut in the US, and with it, Shelton Brothers was born. 'The American Dream' became a reality for Cantillon as it did for Shelton Brothers. It was the beginning of a beautiful friendship.  Twenty years later, we’re warmly welcoming the newest to the Shelton family, Victor. Citoyen du Monde is a celebration of the past we’ve shared and of the future in store. Bon anniversaire et merci mes amis, Jean Van Roy.'	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:44.126897	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
