13025	Alvvays	5307	Saison	4.2	\N	Alvvays is our brand new Table Saison brewed with a fluffy blend of oats, wheat, rye, and flaked barley. We fermented this blend with blend of agrarian and monastic Saison yeast cultures and conditioned it on top of a rustic heap of chamomile flowers. Effervescent, floral, and spritely. Generous honey and fruit throughout, with a nice warming phenolic spice at the end. Alvvays finishes with a bright yet mild acidity that quenches the thirst, but is by no means in the realm of 'sour'. Fluffy and beautiful. You won't believe how drinkable this one is.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:44.316389	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
