16008	Vienndetta	629	Vienna Lager	5.2	\N	We get it: routines are comfortable, monotony is safe, repetition is soothing – everyone has a comfort zone. Take Vienna, a living, ancient symbol of the classics. But why can’t changing the classics also be a symbol? After all, symbols mean nothing without people, and we change all the time – we’re the ones who give them strength. We’re here right with you, feeling the freedom of change, and if you have enough hops we’ll see a taste revolution powerful enough to shake even the most conventional opinions. This is our Vienndetta!An amber lager with soft malts leaving a hint of dryness, Vienndetta has a classic aroma bolstered with earthy, citrus and meadow notes thanks to dry hopping with Summit, Cascade and Willamett. A dab of carbonization helps it go down smoother without ever compromising its undeniably hoppy mood.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.430276	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
15998	Doppio	629	Stout	6.8	\N	A double stout with all the flavour and pep of a cup of joe, but without the bitterness. To pull this one off we had some help from our friends – our friends at Riga’s Rocket Bean Roastery hooked us up with some cold brew coffee made from Brazilian beans. The aroma and aftertaste only add to the roasted malt and caramelization, rounding things off with a light, sweet note.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.430276	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
