18158	Prove It Gruit	5361	Traditional Ale	5.5	\N	Lifting things is impressive. What have you lifted lately? Your telephone? Perhaps a reuben sandwich or two? SPare me the tall tale. You say you lift bro? Prove it. Lift a refrigerator, a tractor, or your mom. Our Gruit is proven to lift the spirit from its darkest hour. Brewed with mugwort, bog myrtle, and lemon verbena, Prove It is our take on the ancient tradition of brewing without hops. So put that training to good use -- pick up this beer.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.283144	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
18147	God Damn Toffee Pigeon Porter	5361	Imperial Porter	8.9	\N	Two old ass English pigeons heard about our porter and decided to cross the pond with a secret mission in mind. Upset with our american twist on the original porter, the crotchety birds broke into the brewery armed with pockets full of toffee - they spiked our beer! Little did they know... Sweet notes of toffee now accompany the roasted profile of our porter, creating a delightful new flavor. Their attempt at sabotage backfired. Those birds should just stick to their tea and crumpets.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.283144	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
