19114	Gold  (Bottle)	5372	Sidro	5.0	\N	Bottled only - available in 330ml & 500ml bottles.This immensely refreshing cider has a light champagne sparke with fruity apple tones and a long-dry finish. The creative blend of bittersweet and dessert apples impart this classic cider with body and crispness. Serve chilled as instant refreshment or enjoy with a hot bowl of pasta.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.608724	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
