15971	Rupjmaize	629	Barley Wine	11.2	\N	It turned out that our our new joint craft, brewed up with Bottle Share Brewery in 2017, was kept northern in both style and substance. We like it that way, and so continued through a line of strong, unconventional beers and found ourselves working through the culture of the Baltics. Namely the gastronomic traditions in Latvia, taking for inspiration Rupjmaize, the country’s original sweetened rye bread.It’s brewed in the style of a rye wine, and in many ways takes from the spirit of the original recipe. Think rye malt, caraway seeds, a dense body, high proof, and notes of freshly baked bread in both its aroma and sweet, malty taste.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.430276	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
15980	Black Run	629	Spiced Beer	5.5	\N	Тёмный эль с резким уклоном в сухость жжёных и лёгкую сладость карамельных солодов. Подходящим для времени года его делают пряные ароматы добавленных ягод можжевельника, лаврового листа, белого перца и розмарина. Мягкий вкус с невысоким градусом позволят набраться решительности, сохранив координацию. Winter is coming. Get out your board because, no matter how cold the weather, it can’t stand up to the sheer heat of blitzing down the slopes! Dig up your skis, keep to your style and feel your body soar downhill – ‘cause we’re talking about Black Run!A dark ale with an unmistakeable roast dryness and the light sweetness of caramel malts, made for just this time of year with the spicy aroma of added juniper, bay leaves, white pepper and rosemary. Its soft taste and low proof give you a boost while never losing its cool.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.430276	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
