22205	Sour Mormora	5424	Sour / Wild Ale	5.3	\N	This coffee-infused kettle sour beer was created with our friends at Square Mile Coffee Roasters. We selected two roasts of Mormora (espresso and filter) to use on both the hot and cold sides of the beer production process. Adjunct: coffee.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.626921	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
