24195	Crepuscolo (Etichetta Oro)	852	American Pale Ale (APA)	5.5	\N	Prodotta con il 100% di malto Pils da orzo dei nostri campi e luppoli americani coltivati in azienda. L’aggiunta di malto speciale conferisce una vivace colorazione ramata. Rifermentata in bottiglia e fusti, è una birra chiara con note agrumate e floreali ed un finale piacevolmente amaro. Birra per ogni occasione! Temperatura di servizio 7 - 8° C.Brewed with 100% of Pils malt from barley of our fields and American hops grown on the farm. The addition of special malt gives a vivid coppery color. Fermented in the bottle and kegs, is a light beer with citrus and floral notes and a pleasantly bitter finish. Beer for every occasion! Serving temperature 7 - 8° C.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
17657	Laughing Fox	5356	Kristallweizen	4.5	\N	In playful pursuit of butterflies a Red Fox danced across the brewery hill. His joy so pure it bubbled through our hearts and into this beer. Laughing Fox is a sparkling Kristal Weizen brewed in the Bavarian tradition with 50% Wisconsin wheat in our open top fermenters. Tickle your nose notes of spicy clove and cinnamon abound. Dan’s inspired Weizen interpretation reflects the deep bittersweet color of our Fox’s red coat. Expect this beer to pour a lively effervescent glass thick with creamy foam and bursting with luscious fruity notes on your pallet. This is easy drinking beer perfect for a friendly Wisconsin evening. Relax, this is God’s Country, here we have the strength to reach for the stars and change the world.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.105645	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
24199	Eclissi	852	Milk/Sweet Stout	6.7	\N	Birra doppio malto scura, stile Chocolate Milk Stout. Rivisitazione in chiave moderna delle stout anglosassoni, brassata con sette malti diversi tra cui quello di frumento, avena e caramello, con l’aggiunta di lattosio e fave di cacao. Setosa e persistente, ben accompagna i dessert a base di cioccolato, creme e frutta secca. Temperatura di servizio 7 - 8°  C. Birra con il sapore dell’orzo e del luppolo friulani: l’emozione di bere la tua terra. Birra viva in continua evoluzione, non pastorizzata e rifermentata in bottiglia. Può contenete lieviti sul fondo. Contiene glutine. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, fave di cacao, lattosio, frumento, avena, luppolo, lievito.Dark beer, Chocolate Milk Stout style. The modern interpretation of the Anglo-Saxon stout, brewed with seven different malts including that of wheat, oats and caramel, with the addition of lactose and cocoa beans. Silky and persistent, this beer goes well with chocolate based desserts, creams and dried fruit. Serving temperature 7 - 8° C. Beer with barley and hops flavor of Friuli: the thrill of drinking your land. Living beer in constant evolution, unpasteurized and fermented in the bottle. Can containing yeast on the bottom. Contains gluten. Ingredients: water, barley malt, cocoa beans, lactose, wheat, oats, hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
24203	Sole Rosso	852	Irish Red Ale	5.0	\N	Birra in stile Irish Red Ale in cui le note del luppolo lasciano spazio alle suggestioni dei malti con un corpo caratterizzato da un caramello leggero ed un finale a cavallo tra il biscottato ed il torrefatto. Temperatura di servizio 7 - 8° C. Birra con il sapore dell’orzo e del luppolo friulani: l’emozione di bere la tua terra. Birra viva in continua evoluzione, non pastorizzata e rifermentata in bottiglia. Può contenete lieviti sul fondo. Contiene glutine. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, frumento, luppolo, lievito.Beer in Irish Red Ale style in which the hop character gives way to the suggestions of malts with a body characterized by a light caramel and a conclusion in between the toasted and roasted. Serving temperature 7 - 8° C. Beer with barley and hops flavor of Friuli: the thrill of drinking your land. Living beer in constant evolution, unpasteurized and fermented in the bottle. Can containing yeast on the bottom. Contains gluten. Ingredients: water, barley malt, wheat, hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
