25101	Sea Monster Imperial Stout	5450	Imperial Stout	10.0	\N	Sea Monster Imperial Stout is a new version of an old favorite.  This hearty stout is black as the abyss and clocks in at a whopping 10% ABV, a real monster.  The flavors of roasted coffee and bittersweet chocolate are complamented by a velvety smoothness from the addition of un-malted barley and oats.  Colombus and Amarillo hops help to balance out the huge malt character of this flavor bomb.  Be careful the alcohol is well hidden and will sneak up on you if you don’t watch out.  Like most scary monsters, it can be a little intimidating, but have no fear.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
