25108	Fathom Ipl (India Pale Lager)	5450	India Pale Lager	7.0	\N	NOTE: This is now a rotating beer, no longer a year round product. The IPA version is new year round version. Please check your bottle/can/tap list before rating.Lager meets IPA in a winning combination.Our Fathom India Pale Lager combines time-honored lagering techniques with the hop profiles of a West Coast IPA recipe. The cold-fermenting lager yeast provides a clean base that allows the citrus and pine aromas from the hops to really shine. The result is a gold medal beer with a refreshing, easy drinking character and just the right amount of depth.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25116	The Commodore	5450	Stout	6.5	\N	American Stout. Black in color with roasted flavor and noticeable hop bitterness.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25106	Grunion Pale Ale	5450	American Pale Ale (APA)	5.5	\N	Our Grunion Pale Ale wasn’t born on a beach, but in a backyard. Originating from an employee-only home brew contest, this award-winning hoppy pale ale is named after the tiny local fish known for late night frolics on shore. A pair of new hop varieties lend strong yet balanced summer melon aromas and herbal flavors, while a soft caramel malt sweetness holds it all together.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
