18156	Denali The Hot Dog Meets The Bush	5361	Saison	7.5	\N	Don’t fight it, Spite It!The Hot Dog Meets the Bush is a collaboration betweenSpiteful and Denali Brewing Company out of Talkeetna, Alaska.We worked together to create a beer with ingredients unique to eachbrewery’s home. For us, here in Chicago, mustard seedsseemed an obvious choice given the city’s obsessionwith the Chicago hot dog. To complement that,Denali brought Alaskan Blueberries with them.Together our ingredients blend for a refreshing Saison	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.283144	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
18160	P.A.C. Forever	5361	Extra Special Bitter	7.6	\N	Don’t fight it, Spite It!People always ask us, why Spiteful?Well, here’s an example: our good friend’s hockey (and favorite)number is between 25 and 27. Because of this, that number is foreverknown as 25B at Spiteful. So we brewed this double ESB for ourbatch #25B to spite him. And just in case you were wondering,P.A.C. stands for People Against Colin.It takes a lot to have an entire organization against you,but trust us, he’s an idiot!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.283144	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
