25413	Shredder	5454	Wheat Ale	4.5	\N	Made in collaboration with Orange Mountain Bikes. We decided that refreshment was the name of the game so have created a beer to quench the thirst after long hours in the saddle. Shredder is a 4.5% wheat beer using 50% wheat in the grist, obviously considering Orange’s involvement it needed to be pretty citrusy, so in addition to zesty coriander seed we added curacao orange peel, seville orange and tangerine juice. Seriously smashable.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618183479302-1e0aa382c36b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618183479302-1e0aa382c36b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25411	The Great Alphonso	5454	American Pale Ale (APA)	5.6	\N	A collaboration with the Fabulous Brodies Beers of London, in true Brodies style we brewed a fruity twist on a modern classic . An all pale malt body and balanced bitterness creates the background to let the fruit shine. We added loads of richly sweet mangos in the boil and again in fermentation to accentuate the tropical fruity character of the Citra hops added in the hop back and in conditioning. Deeply fruity yet deliciously crisp and satisfying, all hail The Great Alphonso!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
