25449	Zirkus	5454	India Pale Lager	5.4	\N	It’s freezing cold at the brewery this time of year, so we’ve brewed a tropically fruity dry-hopped Lager to remind us all of the summer. Featuring Oat and Wheat Malt in addition to our house Golden Promise for a pale and smooth malty base; the beer uses Eureka, Citra and Simcoe hops in both whirlpool and dry-hopping for a juicy-fruit like flavour.Fermented with WLP940 ‘Mexican Lager’ yeast for a clean body and crisply moreish finish, perfect to chase away those winter blues	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25455	Robots Vs Clowns	5454	India Pale Lager	5.3	\N	A collaboration with Gigantic Brewing of Portland Oregon. Golden promise along with two types of oats give a simple but smooth mouthfeel. De-bittered Mosaic hops were added in the kettle and then Amarillo was added to the FV before transfer. The beer was then fermented cold using lager yeast before undergoing an extended maturation of 6 weeks and further dry hop additions of Amarillo and Mosaic. Crisp, fruity and drinkable just as all lager should be.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
