25443	/ North  Co Things You Can'T Unsee	5454	Bitter Ale	4.4	\N	A collaborative brew with our friends from North Brew Co. After much discussion we decided we’d represent our Yorkshire roots by brewing an updated take on a satisfyingly drinkable Yorkshire Bitter. A beautiful amber brown colour, and a sweetly smooth body from the crystal heavy malt bill. As a modern spin we went for resin like pine, citrus and orange flavours from the hops rather than the usual earthy and floral. Fermented with estery ale yeast for a lingering moreish finish.Malts: Golden Promise, Crystal Light 120, T50 Crystal Malt, Vienna Malt, Chocolate MaltHops: Whole Leaf Amarillo, Cascade, Simcoe Cryo Hops™ Simcoe, Amarillo. T90 Huell Melon, CascadeYeast: WLP002	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
