19232	Fox In The Snow	5373	Lambic - Fruit	8.4	\N	Foedre aged Kriek style ale fermented with cherriesGravity: 16.1 PMalts: Pils, Vienna, Special Aromatic, Carawheat, Raw WheatHops: Nugget, StreisselspaltSecret Ingredients: Wild yeasts, Balaton and Montmorency cherries, 15 year old Barolo Foedre(from label)A shock of red as if glimpsing a fox dart into the forest’s edge, bursting with it’s namesakes unbridled wild edge and vinous tannin from an 11 month rest in one of our Barolo foedre then refermented for a further two months with cherries.(from http://www.offcolorbrewing.com/releases)our first kriek(from http://twitter.com/OffcolorBrewing/status/1071105730642698240)	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.608724	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
19233	Tummy Time	5373	Grodziskie/Gose/Lichtenhainer	6.0	\N	Gose style ale fermented with Torulaspora delbrueckiiGravity: 11.5 PMalts: Pils, Victory, Carapils, Wheat, Oat Malt, Flaked Oats, Flaked BarleyHops: ColumbiaSecret Ingredients: French Gray Sea Salt, Green Coriander, Lemon Zest, Rolling over(from label)a unique gose merging a classic beer style with our penchant for experimentation. A mixed fermentation between our house lactobacillus, a traditional Belgian wit yeast, and another weirdo wild yeast called Torulaspora delbrueckii creates a subtly complex beer with chardonnay aromas that manages to be creamy, juicy, and tangy all at the same time. French gray sea salt as well as coriander and lemon peel round out the mouthfeel despite the drying finish.(from http://www.facebook.com/OffColorBrewing/photos/a.455693294537950/2276542162453045)	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.608724	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
