26925	Hotel	5471	Imperial Porter	8.2	\N	Hotel is an Imperial Porter of 8.2% strength, brewed with ale yeast (so its not a Baltic Porter, technically). Silky smooth and nicely balanced, this beer can only be found in bottles at the brewery on Saturdays, beginning December 12, as long as supplies last. We have just over 60 cases and don’t expect them to last more than 2 or 3 weeks.In draft, we filled 65 half kegs which will be going to markets in PA, OH, MD, MA, and FL.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.15433	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
19381	Cannamela	727	Spiced Beer	4.3	\N	Birra artigianale siracusana, non pastorizzata, non filtrata. Profumata, amara, pungente, con scorze di limone femminello siracusano IGP e menta nepitella selvatica. Vi sentirete come sulle coste della Sicilia. Dorata e secca, si abbina con pizza e pasta. Perfetta per ogni momento della giornata. Leggeri sedimenti sono indice di qualità. Servire a 6 - 8° C. Contiene glutine. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, grano duro di Sicilia, avena, scorze di limone di Siracusa, menta selvatica, luppolo, lievito, zucchero di canna. Handrafted Mediterranean Golden Ale beer, unfiltered, unpateurized. Perfumed, bitter, dry, with Siracusa’s lemon peels IGP and wild mint. You will feel like on the coast of Sicily. Golden and dry, it is combined with pizza and pasta. Perfect for every moment of the day. Small amount of sediment are quality proof. Serve at 6 - 8° C. Contains gluten. Ingredients: water, barley malt, Sicilian durum wheat, rye, Siracusa lemon peel, wild mint, hops, yeast, brown sugar.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.608724	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
19382	Giudecca	727	Fruit Beer	6.9	\N	Birra artigianale rossa doppio malto, ad alta fermentazione, non filtrata, non pastorizzata, naturale. Forte, fruttata, selvaggia. Realizzata con l’unica pianta che cresce sulla roccia lavica, il Fico d’India dell’Etna DOP, fornito dal Consorzio Euroagrumi. Dal colore rosso arancio, si abbina con piatti in agrodolce, salumi e formaggi stagionati. Consigliata per cene informali e festeggiamenti. Leggeri sedimenti sono indice di qualità. Servire a 6 - 8° C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto di orzo, malto di frumento, Fico d’India dell’Etna DOP, luppolo, lievito.Handrafted, high fermentation, unfiltered, unpateurized, natural red beer. Strong, fruity, wild. Made with the only plant growing on the lava rock, the Etna’s prickly pear DOP, provided by the Euroagrumi Consortium. From orange to red, it combines with sweet, sour dish and cured meats. Recommended for casual dinners and celebrations. Small amount of sediment are quality proof. Serve at 6 - 8 ° C. Ingredients: water, barley malt, wheat malt, Etna PDO tuna, hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.608724	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
19384	Turba	727	Smoked	7.1	\N	Rauch etnea. Affumicata, abboccata, enigmatica. Dal colore marrone con un corpo leggero e prodotta con pregiati malti inglesi. Viene affumicata con legno di quercia dell’Etna. Abbinamenti: carni, cioccolata fondente e sigari. Servire a 8 - 10° C.Smoky, full, enigmatic. Brown with a light body and produced with precious British malts. Barricade with oak’s wood from Etna. Matching: steak, dark chocolate and cigars. Serve at 8 - 10° C.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.608724	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
