19611	Oud Bruin Fût De Moeder	5376	Oud Bruin	6.0	\N	THE MOTHER OUD BRUIN !This anniversary beer is an Oud Bruin in its purest form. It comes from the mother-barrel, the birth mother of our Oud Bruin production.This barrel originated in France. Alex brought it with him 8 years ago in his Nissan Micra, at the cost of his luggage, which had to be left behind.On an ice cold winter night in 2009, a freshly brewed dark wort was tainted by the Bellegem air. After its wild night under the stars, the pregnant wort was transported to the French barrel that resided in Alex’ basement.The wild yeasts and bacteria reigned for a year and a half in the beer. After that, the beer was put on draught and served at the Zythos Beer Festival in Leuven.The brewers collected the yeast that was left behind on the bottom of the barrel and divided it over five new barrels containing new beer. The Verzet Oud Bruin process was born.This unique culture is maintained by repeatedly grafting the yeast from a barrel of old beer onto a barrel of new beer.The beer that you are now drinking is the third generation that has resided in the Mother-barrel and it stayed 2,5 years in the barrel.In honour of Moeder Lambic Original 10th anniversary, we give the content of our most important barrel to Andy, Jean and their entourage. With this gift, we would like to thank them for their unconditional support from the very beginning, for their trust, for the pleasant cooperation and their friendship.A toast to your Moeder!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.77706	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
