27307	Titania 2016	5475	Imperial Stout	10.0	\N	Titania takes a big, bold beer and makes it bigger and bolder. We aged our Long Dark Voyage to Uranus Imperial Stout in Heaven Hill Kentucky Bourbon Barrels allowing it to develop an entirely new depth of flavour. LDV’s intense dark chocolate and coffee notes remain present, but are joined by flavours of vanilla, coconut, charred oak, and a slight bourbon element. The creamy mouthfeel and combination of flavours create a fudge-like character which makes Titania highly drinkable.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.324333	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
