20252	Blu Violent	5386	Fruit Beer	12.0	\N	BLU VIOLENT is a medieval blueberry ale conceived and brewed with the infamous Brewmaster Brian from Stillwater Artisanal Ales. Caramelized for hours in the kettle, then violently fermented to perfection with tons of blueberry - literally! Just the right amount of lime adds the artistic balance we sought, and a welcome depth of flavor.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
28078	Monsters' Park - Tennessee Whiskey Barrel	5482	Imperial Stout	13.0	\N	This is Monsters’ Park, our hulking, cantakerous imperial stout, aged in fragrant, oaky Tennessee whiskey barrels. The barrel character is immediately evident on the nose and only grows more intense in the flavor. Notes of corn whiskey, caramel, and vanilla meld with the huge roast character of Monsters’ Park to create a balanced barrel-aged beer experience. The beer’s aroma & flavor reach their peak when the beer is allowed to warm up a bit, so don’t get all antsy and drink it right out of the fridge.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.659413	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
