28079	Sleepless City - Vanilla & Cocoa Nibs	5482	Brown Ale	5.7	\N	Sleepless City is a brown ale loaded with our house roasted coffee and lovingly spiced with vanilla beans and cocoa nibs. The base brown ale is super tasty in its own right, with prominent notes of toast, chocolate, and fresh bread. The coffee and spice additions take this delicious profile to decadent new heights, delivering a harmonious union of flavors that is rich, complex, and exquisitely balanced. It’s an enormously successful combination of meticulously selected ingredients, and you’re totally about to drink it. Get psyched.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.659413	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
28084	Transit Of Venus - Raspberry & Peaches	5482	Sour / Wild Ale	5.6	\N	This sensationally tasty grisette–a sessionable relative of the saison, originally hailing from Belgium’s Hainaut province–was brought to delicious fruition via a rye-forward malt bill and a Brett-heavy amalgam of our house microflora. The resulting beer is delightfully refreshing and intriguingly complex, with a profile that’s rustic, spicy, and peppered with notes of hay and pastoral funk that rest lightly on a crisp, lemony acidity. We catapulted this batch to dizzying heights of flavor via generous additions of raspberries & peaches, which combine with the complex-yet-crushable profile to yield a truly magnificent drinking experience. Brace yourself.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.659413	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20253	5-Alarm Chili Beer - American Style	5386	Spiced Beer	8.0	\N	5-Alarm Chili Beer: American Style is a uniquely balanced hot and spicy alarm-red ale made in collaboration with Siren Craft Brew in England!We made the “English-style” at their brewery, and then came back to Hoppin’ Frog and brewed our “American-style” batch. We brewed ours with lots of chipotle and Morita peppers for a solid hot pepper taste, and just the right amounts of black pepper, cayenne, habanero, and Thai chili peppers to create complex, assertive, and satisfying flavors of a good bowl of 5-alarm chili!Using an over-abundance of red caramelized malts to nicely balance out the spicy heat, this beer gives the chili and hot pepper lovers something to truly enjoy, and share with their like-minded fiery friends.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
