28145	Byzantine Vision	5483	Baltic Porter	10.7	\N	The rich flavors of baklava conjure memories from lifetimes ago when early trade systems oozed around the globe, mixing the delicate ingredients of humanity ever closer together. In places where philosophy and art layered atop advancements in science and industry, it was a recipe destined to rise.Our first 2017 Stasis Project release is rooted in the bourbon barrel aged version of our World Beer Cup 2016 Silver Medal winning ’Cobaltic Porter.’ Racked over hazelnuts, pistachios, and walnuts then finished with wild honey, this beer is a delicate nod to the innovators and inspirations of ages past.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.659413	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20272	Guru Of The Dark	5386	Schwarzbier	6.3	\N	This special beer was brewed in collaboration with the winner of the famous Cattle Baron's Ball, which is a charity event held yearly to benefit the American Cancer Society. This year's winner was especially fun to work with because of his advanced palate and keen interest in yoga, so we designed a beer perfect for inner contemplation. Bringing inner peace by the pint is achieved with heaps of the finest chocolate and just a pinch of pink Himalayan sea salt, for a great combination of flavors in this tasty dark lager. Concentrate on the center of your universe and contemplate the meaning of life, as you enjoy this whirlwind of delicious flavors. What you think, you become....what you feel, you attract....what you imagine, you create. Ohmmmmm.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
