21085	Helles Gluten Free	773	Helles	4.8	\N	Birra chiara dal color giallo chiaro. Malti chiari provenienti dalla Germania. Luppolo coltivato nel Tettnang, in Germania. Lievito da bassa fermentazione (saccharomyces carlsbergensis). Al naso presenta aromi erbacei e floreali. In bocca presenta un amaro non troppo intenso con un sapore mielato e luppolato. Gluten Free la rende adatta a tutti. Servire a 6 - 8° C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, luppolo, lievito. 11.6° Plato. Light yellow beer. Light malts from Germany. Hops grown in Tettnang, Germany. Low fermentation yeast (saccharomyces carlsbergensis). The nose has herbaceous and floral aromas. In the mouth has a bitter taste not too intense with a honeyed and hoppy flavor. Gluten Free makes it suitable for everyone. Serve at 6 - 8° C. Ingredients: water, barley malt, hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.2812	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
