29967	Seasonal Stash 2016	5501	Stout	4.7	\N	(English Below) Seasonal Stash er vårt forsøk på å levere en stout i butikkstyrke med de samme egenskapene som de langt kraftigere, mørke ølene vi brygger. Ølet er brygget eksklusivt for Gulating, og er en søt stout med svakt preg av kanel og vanilje.Navnet er et anagram, men for hva?----------------------------------Seasonal Stash is our attempt at a Norwegian store-strength beer (< 4.7% abv) bearing the same qualities as the stronger, darker beers in our portfolio. Seasonal Stash is brewed exclusively for Gulating. It is a sweet stout with a delicate hint of cinnamon and vanilla.The name is an anagram. But that is left for you to figure out.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:50.156454	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
