29969	Boregasm	5501	American Pale Ale (APA)	4.7	\N	Store-strength beers in Norway (< 4.7%) can be rather boring because low-ABV styles don’t lend themselves well to the general sacrifices that need to be made to keep prices down. Often people will market their low-ABV pale ales as IPAs to help drive sales.Because of this, we’ve decided to give you a boregasm with our pale ale. This beer is hopped with doses of fruity hops that are otherwise suited to our other 'normal-strength' IPAs. Boregasm is a refreshing beer for hop lovers, brewed without compromise. And it’s not an IPA, it’s a well-hopped pale ale! Drink it fresh!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:50.156454	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
