21508	/ Arcadia Floky	786	Blanche	6.3	\N	Strong Hoppy Blanche. Birra bianca con pera, non pastorizzata e non filtrata. Rifermentata in bottiglia. Colore giallo velato. Birra ad alta fermentazione. Fløki viene preparata nel periodo invernale da Sognandobirra con la collaborazione di Birra Arcadia utilizzando pere dei circa duecento alberi rimasti del pero Misso di Lessina e luppoli neozelandesi creando un mix di sentori di frutta dalla polpa gialla, preludio all’estate e alle prelibatezze stagionali. Abbinamenti: formaggi, salumi, pizza. Servire a 7 - 11° C . Ingredienti: acqua, malto d'orzo, malto di frumento, fiocchi di frumento, estratto di pero Misso, zucchero, lievito, buccia d’arancia amara, coriandolo.White beer with pear, unpasteurized and unfiltered. Refermented in the bottle. Yellow veiled. High fermentation beer. Fløki is prepared in the winter by Sognandobirra with the collaboration of Birra Arcadia using pears of about two hundred remaining Misso trees of Lessina and New Zealand hops creating a mix of hints of fruit with a yellow pulp, a prelude to summer and seasonal delicacies. Pairings: cheeses, salami, pizza. Serve at 7 - 11° C. Ingredients: water, barley malt, wheat malt, wheat flakes, pearo Misso extract, sugar, yeast, bitter orange peel, coriander.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.2812	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
21692	Ann	5413	Saison	6.5	\N	Ann is the wine barrel aged version of Anna (1902-?), our grandfather’s sister as well as the name of our Honey Saison. In her honor, we fill French Oak wine barrels with honey saison and allow the beer to mature in the presence of our resident microflora. After many months, a beautifully complex beer emerges--Anna becomes Ann. Naturally carbonated and dipped in beeswax, Ann displays the microflora of her landscape. This the ale that I dreamed to have shared with Anna.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.450619	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
