392	Sadwave Ipa	132	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.5	\N	Sadwave IPA is juicy NE IPA with a radical amount of Mosaic hops all the way, and this release is collaboration with online music web zine Sadwave.comSadwave is a website, publishing house and a small tour agency that has grown up from the experience of international underground DIY/punk scene. A small, but very interesting world where we have no intermediate links between the author, the reader and musicians. Sadwave from 2011 overviews music and various cultural events of Russian and international scenes and remains our hiding place among the deafening info-noise of modern times, a harbor, which always has something to listen to and to read for those who love punk, hardcore, ska, indie, reggae, oi! and other musical genres, the existence of which becomes possible due to the passion and altruism of the participants of the scene all over the world.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-21 23:16:05.543825	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
