704	Barbarian Fishing	140	Double IPA	8.0	\N	Get into the boat! As he is originally a masshole, Stephen was dreaming of fishing on Lake Chaubunagungamaug while brewing this New England IPA. This style is characterised by an abundance of fruity hops, the specific Conan yeast and a dry hop during fermentation that enhances the fruitiness of the aromas, while providing a rich mouthfeel and an experience very different from your average IPA. Wicked Fawkin’ Pissa!Ingredients: Malt (Pale, Carapils, Dark Wheat), Hops (Warrior, Cascade Simcoe, Centennial, Citra), Demerara sugar, Yeast (Conan)	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-21 23:19:23.313396	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
705	Twisted Kipper	140	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.3	\N	You are hereby cordially invited to our Spicy Pineapple Party! Twisted Kipper is our expressive and aromatic IPA. It is a beer that packs all the bitter and fruity flavours of a fresh IPA with a typical 'De Kromme Haring' twist. Not only did we put loads of aromatic hops in this beer (about 15 g/L), we also fermented it with Sacch. Trois. This is one of our favourite yeasts as it generates complex fruity esters. These lock in very well with the fruity hop aromas, twisting this kipper in unexpected ways.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-21 23:19:23.538614	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
709	/ Frontaal Apistogramma	140	Double IPA	8.7	\N	Brouwerij Frontaal makes the meanest NEIPAs in the low countries, Brewpub De Kromme Haring is known for its adventurous choices in all things yeast-related. The Apistogramma is a proper collaboration: an outrageous New England style Double IPA with two types of yeast and a huge amount of interesting hops. Take the plunge and explore these tropical waters with us!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-21 23:19:24.438715	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
714	/ Ruig Ruige	140	Double IPA	8.5	\N	Imperial TROIS IPA (9% ABV) -- Brewed in collaboration with RUIG Bier. A double IPA, but not one of those your grandma would drink. Filled to the brim with C-hops and fermented with a yeast with an identity crises (Saccharomyces Trois, or the yeast formerly known as Brettanomyces Trois).	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-21 23:19:25.562033	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
