749	Indian Tribute	5187	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.6	\N	Our tribute to India. This demands that we make a beer with flavor and aroma wich creates lasting memories. The type of beer is American India Pale Ale. This means a beer with strong hop charachter seasoned with mainly American hops. This beer won gold at the Stockholm Beer o Whisky Festival in 2008, 2010,2012 and 2013 and was also awarded 'best craft beer' in 2008 by the Swedish home brewers association. Indian Tribute has been in Systembolaget's regular assortment since 4 June 2012.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-21 23:19:33.538345	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
