3481	Grape Peel Session: Sour Side	233	Session IPA	4.5	\N	Each record has a back side. Sometimes the B-side is just a bonus track, sometimes it's a remix, acoustic or instrumental version of the main song, and sometimes the B-side becomes an equal hit, like Roadhouse Blues from Doors, We Will Rock You from Queen or Brown Girl in the Ring. Boney M. So our all-weather hit, Grape Peel Session IPA, has a downside - Grape Peel Session: Sour Side. The same peeled and hand-squeezed red grapefruits, the same dry-hop trio of Citra, Amarillo and Galaxy, the same lightness and sessionness, but this time the pH regulator is turned down to the lower values, and the refreshing citrus effect has reached the brink of perception ... Summer’s almost gone, die like that with music!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.732745	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
