3713	Beer Money Inc.	5218	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.0	\N	Beer Money Inc. is a 6% IPA packed with Mosaic, Citra and Simcoe! Named after the TNA tag team comprised of Bobby Roode and James Storm.Mosaic and Citra are often used to unleash waves of tropical and citrus flavours into your beer, but they also have some great woodsy earth flavours. Put alongside the musky bittering of Simcoe, all of those flavours come out leaving the fruity notes more commonly associated with these hops.We’ve chosen to flip the table over and showcase these earthy flavours and keep the fruit notes as undertones. The result is a smooth, bitter brew with a good smack of citrus fruit and masses of fresh herbal flavours. 13°P	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.915778	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
