4544	Down Deeper Double Ipa	5228	Double IPA	10.2	\N	Cask; Special. Also available bottled.This one-off brew was made especially for the CamRGB ’down DIPS’ night of double IPAs on 26th May 2012.  We decided to keep the recipe quite simple: low colour Maris Otter in the mash followed by an enormous quantity of Aussie and Kiwi hops in the copper.  Watch out for this one - it’s a bit hoppy!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.111027	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
4546	Black Eyed Ipa	5228	Black IPA	6.5	\N	Cask; Occasional. Also available bottle conditioned.The name makes very little sense, and indeed the style itself is a bit wrong if you put any thought into it. The beer does, however, work very well indeed. To create this fully loaded Black IPA we used large amounts of Maris Otter, Cara and Carafa III malts to create a wonderfully sweet black wort. Before boiling we add a load of hops. During the boil we add a load of hops. After the boil we add a load of hops. You get the idea - lots of hops!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.288158	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
