7114	Hop Tripper	5248	Double IPA	7.4	\N	San Diego Double IPAOnce in a while we’re fortunate enough to brew with true brewing royalty, Hop Tripper is one such instance where Master Brewer Mitch Steele of New Realm Brewing (ex-Stone) joined forces with Team Fourpure to create this surprisingly drinkable beast of a Double IPA. It’s our most heavily hopped beer to date, being dry hopped twice with a combination of Centennial, Simcoe and a touch of Citra. All the hops were added late in the brewing process to maximise flavour and aroma whilst providing the smoothest possible bitterness. Light golden in colour and weighing in at 70 IBU, you’ll find a fragrant floral nose, with plenty of citrus flavours, some lemon zest, passionfruit and pine. Here comes the Hop Tripper.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.22296	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
