7123	Tea Time	5248	Session IPA	3.7	\N	Earl grey session ipa. Tea time just got cool again. This is a super smashable, hoppy number infused with the best Earl Grey tea we could find. First we used four different American hop varieties to create a super juicy, tropical session beer. Then, we infused the beer with fresh orange and lemon zest, finally, we added the tea. The result: the perfect afternoon thirst quencher.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.22296	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
7124	Passion Drop	5248	India Pale Ale (IPA)	7.4	\N	Many of the most exciting modern hop varieties exhibit interesting tropical fruit flavours, which is why we decided to make this IPA that's absolutely bursting with passion fruit.We combined four different malts to create a clean, simple backdrop for our good old friends Simcoe Citra and Mosaic to do their thing, giving this beer an explosive hop aroma and flavours reminiscent of Mango, Grapefruit and yes, Passion fruit. Then we doubled down on the whole passionfruit thin by overloading our fermenter with passionfruit, which gives this beer an almost overwhelmingly tropical fruit character, and a subtle refreshing tartness.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.22296	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
