8231	Beer Week 2014 Ipa	5257	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.5	\N	This is a beer that was floated by Sacramento Beer Week organizers and Peter Hoey from Brewers Supply Group. It was originally intended to be brewed as a Pale Ale by a number of the local breweries. However, we just finished brewing a whole bunch of Hoppy Palm Pale Ale and figured an IPA would better suit to Sac market. Beer Week IPA is finishing up this week in the tanks and will be 6.5% ABV and is hopped principally with CTZ, El Dorado and Chinook.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.622897	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
8234	/ Altamont Project X Red Ipa	5257	India Pale Ale (IPA)	5.5	\N	Red IPA Collaboration for 2016 SF Beer Week from Track 7, Sacramento & Altamont Beer Works, Livermore.There was to be no denying this storybook brewery bromance. Two purveyors of lupulin awesomeness separated by 80 miles of interstate, farm fields and a mountain pass fought against all odds and notions of corporate responsibility to bring about something that no HR rep could possibly be proud of.Project X started as a conversation over a pallet of malt in the depths of Altamont Beer Works and evolved during a pensive brainstorming session and evolved yet-again. Track 7’s version of the Red India Pale Lager was ditched out due to low yeast viability and performance anxiety and was quickly patched over with our surrogate house ale yeast.This nullius filius is comprised of Red X, acid malt and a copious amount of hops. Virtually all the hops are late addition, imparting flavor and aroma to spare without a lot of hop bitterness. Blood red in hue and dank in nose, we hope to shock your collective systems.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.622897	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
