10913	Hillbilly Wine	5284	Double IPA	9.0	\N	Passionfruit & Oak India Pale AleAs part of our continued experimentation with wood and beer, Hillbilly Wine is a complex, full-flavoured IPA. In orderto complement the big, sweet and juicy base brew we’ve added passionfruit for a distinctive and slightly tart edge. We then used our custom Spinbot to circulate the beer on oak chips, bringing delicate, toasty notes of vanilla and light tobacco plus a unique mouthfeel.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.562328	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
