10936	Summer Citra Party	5284	Double IPA	8.0	\N	It was a beautiful July morning and there was a problem in the brewhouse; we’d been let down on some ingredients for the beer in the schedule. Not keen on the prospect of a day off, our brewers immediately checked our malt stocks and raided the hop store, and pulled out an IPA recipe they’d been saving for a sunny day. Fresh Summit, Comet, Summer, Amarillo and Citra shine here in a summer special. 8% ABV.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.562328	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
