11644	Braukunst Live! Skull Jacked Triple Ipa	5292	Double IPA	9.1	\N	Brewed for Braukunst Live 2017.Beer style: This beer is a collaboration brew with our friend Frank Boer and the BrauKunstLive Festival. When we put first thoughts into this beer we were looking into a big IPA. This beer is a symphony of 12 different hops, such as Nelson Sauvin, Hüll Melon, Citra, Cascade, Hallertauer Mittelfrüh and Motueka …. In its complexity a description in words is a challenging task, but red berry notes and tropical fruit aromas within others are dominant. Please enjoy and let us know your impression and interpretation of this unique beer!! See you shortly at the BrauKunstLive Festival.Hopfengestopfter, obergäriger heller dreifach Bock OG: 19,5°P TG: 4.5°P Abv 9,1 %	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.944228	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
