14222	Radio The Mothership	5319	Double IPA	8.5	\N	Fruity, bitter hops, berry, mango, peach; a wonderful interplay between the earthy bitterness, the nuanced fruity berry character, and the piney funky tropical depth. The resinous character of the hops shows through in a tongue-coating mouth feel. You’ll really feel saturated by all the hops. Delicious.Flavour Hops: Mosaic, Citra and SimcoeAroma Hops: Mosaic, Citra and SimcoeDry Hop: Mosaic, Citra and SimcoeMalt: 2-Row, Carafoam, Flaked Wheat, Dextrose sugarRecommended Serving Glass:Tulip	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:44.888783	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
