14235	Project: Ipa Project #2	5319	India Pale Ale (IPA)	7.1	\N	IPA #2 is PACKED FULL of Mosaic, Simcoe and Waimea hops, this IPA is exploding with flavour. Beautifully balanced these three tropical, citrus & pine heavy hops leave our IPA #2 a heavy hitter and a hop hunters dream. Our experimentation with New Zealand Waimea resulted in a rare harmony between dry, sweet and bitter. The body is cloudy yet refined using the malt backbone as a vessel to bring these hops to life. Drink this fresh as it is sure not to be around for long! Hops: Mosaic, Simcoe, and WaimeaMalt: Pilsner, 2-Row, Oats, Flaked Oats, Flaked WheatRecommended Serving Glass:Tulip	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:44.888783	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
