14562	Draft Lab: English Ipa	5321	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.0	\N	Brewed with English Maris Otter Pale Ale malt, widely considered the finest available, this is the big brother to our English Pale Ale. This malt lends a rich honeyed, nutty depth, and with the earthy, floral, herbal contribution of East Kent Golding hops. Dry-hopping with East Kent Golding and Styrian Golding hops adds notes of mint and ginger.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.075114	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
