15489	Wango Tango Tangerine Ipa	5329	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.4	\N	It’s time to Wango ze Tango with this tangerine-infused IPA from the folks who introduced the style to St. Louis more than 10 years ago. Hazy and golden in the glass, Wango Tango delivers beer drinking refreshment and a fresh-squeezed citrus kick in every sip. We create the bold citrus character with pureed tangerines and a blend of Centennial and Mosaic hops. The result is a juicy IPA that’s sure to please the palates of all who love to Wango Tango!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.252128	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
15505	Green Hop Ipa	5329	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.0	\N	A Missouri/Tennessee collaboration celebrating the 2014 harvest season!  We brewed a special fresh-hopped IPA with a blend of Cascade, Centennial, Columbus, and Nugget from Dave and Catyas Willowbrook Hop Farm in Murfreesboro, Tennessee.  Expect aromas of wildflowers, citrus, and fresh cut grass.  A Midwestern IPA with a Southern terroir.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.252128	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
