15988	Catalyst	629	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.8	\N	DDH OAT IPA / ABV 6.8% / IBU 40 / OG 16.0 °PWe continue to tweak the IPA in our own special way. Catalyst is our latest experience with double dry hopping with the astounding lupulin strain of pollen – with a handful of silky oat flakes thrown in for good measure, of course.Since the sun’s been making a slow return back down to the horizon, we decided to add a little light to the mix. The brew turned out quite bright, with a gold sheen thrown off by specially selected oat flakes that make up 30% of the ingredients. This mighty proportion gently clouds the drink, complimenting the added hoppy lupulin made from Mosaic and Citra.The aroma’s saturated through with fruit and fresh hops and an added scoop of fresh Amarillo.Thick and soft, like a fresh, sunny fall morning on a cleaned oat field.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.430276	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
