16514	Foraging Racoon	640	India Pale Ale (IPA)	7.0	\N	Formerly known as 7x70 IPAStarts with a citric burst from the Chinook and EXP 07270 hops in the whirlpool. An extra lean malt bill of only 2 row and a touch of lightly toasted oats lets the hop flavors shine while just balancing the firm hop bitterness. A substantial dry hop gives a boost of tropical fruit, citrus and a slap of pine from Chinook, El Dorado, Jarrylo, and Citra hops. Pure hops. No nonsense.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.602229	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
