18903	Hoppy Duck	710	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.3	\N	Birra ad alta fermentazione. Birra leggermente ambrata dal profumo fruttato con sentori di agrumi, resina e di frutta tropicale. Al naso è fresca e predominano sentori di frutta tropicale, agrumi con leggere note speziate. Malti: Pilsner, Carapils, Carahell, Carared e Caramonaco II. Luppoli: East Kent Golding, Magnum, Amarillo, Cascade e Citra. Lievito: Lievito americano ad alta fermentazione. Temperatura di servizio 8 - 10°C. Ingredienti, acqua, malto d’orzo, luppolo, lievito.Top-fermented beer. Slightly amber beer with a fruity aroma with hints of citrus, resin and tropical fruit. The nose is fresh and predominate hints of tropical fruit, citrus and light spicy notes. Malts: Pilsner, Carapils, Carahell, Carared and Caramonaco II. Hops: East Kent Golding, Magnum, Amarillo, Cascade and Citra. High fermentation American yeast. Serving temperature 8 - 10° C. Ingredients, water, barley malt, hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.444456	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
18906	Dark Hop	710	Black IPA	5.0	\N	Birra ad alta fermentazione. Birra scura, con schiuma color cappuccino, cremosa e persistente, dai delicati profumi di resina e agrumi che si alternano alle note torrefatte. In bocca prevale l’amaro dato dai malti scuri e dall’intensa luppolatura. Malti: Pilsner prodotto con orzo coltivato in Italia, Carafa III, Chocolate, Black, Caramonaco II, Crystal 150. Fiocchi di avena. Luppoli: Magnum, Amarillo, Centennial, Chinook, Idaho#7 e Cascade. Temperatura di servizio 8 - 10°C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, avena, luppolo, lievito.Top-fermented beer. Dark beer, cappuccino-colored, creamy and persistent, with delicate aromas and citrus resin alternating with roasted notes. In the mouth prevails bitterness from dark malts and the intense hopping. Malts: Pilsner made from barley grown in Italy, Carafa III, Chocolate, Black, Caramonaco II, Crystal 150. Oat flakes. Hops: Magnum, Amarillo, Centennial, Chinook, Idaho # 7 and Cascade. Serving temperature 8 - 10° C. Ingredients: water, malted barley, oats, hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.444456	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
18908	White Horse	710	Session IPA	4.5	\N	Birra ad alta fermentazione, non filtrata, non pastorizzata, rifermentata in bottiglia. Birra chiara a bassa gradazione alcolica. Al naso è fresca e predominano sentori di frutta tropicale, ananas, arancia, pompelmo e scorza di limone. In bocca la birra è morbida, fragrante, leggermente carbonatata, un corpo leggero che ne fa una birra estremamente beverina e rinfrescante. Malti: Pilsner, Carapils e Carahell. Luppoli: Magnum, Centennial, Cascade, Citra e Sorachi Ace. Temperatura di servizio 6 - 8°C. Ingredienti, acqua, malto d’orzo, malto di frumento, fiocchi di avena, luppolo, lievito.Top-fermented beer, unfiltered, unpasteurized, fermented in the bottle. Light beer with low alcohol content. The nose is fresh and predominate hints of tropical fruit, pineapple, orange, grapefruit and lemon peel. In the mouth the beer is soft, fragrant, lightly carbonated, a lightweight body that makes it a very drinkable and refreshing beer. Malts: Pilsner, Carapils and Carahell. Hops: Magnum, Centennial, Cascade, Citra and Sorachi Ace. Serving temperature 6 - 8° C. Ingredients, water, barley malt, wheat malt, oats, hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.444456	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
