20227	Tower Tuesday Infusion B - Double Ipa	5386	Double IPA	8.2	\N	Infusion B -- which clocks in at 8.2 percent alcohol by volume -- is Mean Manalishi infused with Citra and Cascade hops. It’s part of the new Tower Tuesday Series of small-batch beers available exclusively at the Hoppin’ Frog Tasting Room. The series is an offshoot of the brewery’s popular Tower Tuesdays program, in which beers are run through a giant tower filled with various ingredients that infuse the beer with new flavors.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20241	Teeny Tiny Test Batch Ipa Vol. 2	5386	India Pale Ale (IPA)	7.0	\N	Brewing IPAs is the perfect combination of art and science - the ones that do it best balance both perfectly. That takes a lot of imagination and experimentation, which is where our Teeny Tiny Test Batch IPAs were developed. Now we have the absolute finest American hops from the actual crops that we selected and are having great success testing their qualities at our brewery. And when we create one of these great IPA recipes, we plan to take it from 10 gallons to 10 barrels, and share it with the world!!Hops featured each batch can be determined by the cap color on the bottle. Teeny Tiny Test Batch No. 2 features MOTUEKA hops and a brown cap.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
