22811	Saturate	823	Double IPA	8.0	\N	Mosaic DIPASaturate is a dry-hopping black hole. It kicks o a series where we take a single hop and push it to its limits - beginning with Mosaic. From a simplified grist of Floor Malted Maris Otter, Wheat Malt and Oats - Saturate begins with Columbus & Mosaic in the whirlpool before a 4 stage dry hop building to a dry hop rate of 20g/L all the while being fermented on our house English ale yeast. It’s an up-close look into the spectrum of Mosaic’s aroma ranging from pineapples, passionfruit, pine and blueberries with a favour that continues through tropical fruits to a pithy resinous finish.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.794426	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
