23784	There’a A Beer In My Fridge, And I Need A Drink	5439	New England IPA	7.2	\N	Cloudwater is deservedly one of the most sought after brewers in Europe these days, and are known for their massively-hopped, juicy, hazy IPAs.We think we do a pretty good job as well... so this brew was an easy choice to make. Since, we have yet to see a DDH hazy Rye IPA out there, we thought we’d introduce our beloved rye into the IPA mix. Rye is known for its spicy, smooth character which is complemented by the beautiful mouthfeel of Golden Promise Pale malt.We then juiced it twice with hops though our new HopGun. We tripled-down on the dankness with Chinook, Mosaic and Simcoe, then gave it a blast of Citra which this IPA couldn’t do without.  18.9°	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.124448	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
23791	Christmas Shake	5439	India Pale Ale (IPA)	5.9	\N	Aaah.. julen er på vei, men vi har blitt lei av alle karamellbombene som blir laget. Så i år bestemte vi oss for å gjøre noe annerledes til jul, og har derfor laget en Milkshake IPA med mango, pasjonsfrukt, vanilje og laktose. Vi er veldig glad i denne snope-ølen vår, og håper du også er det! God Jul!We thought about how we should make a Christmas beer. This is just our way to be different. A Christmas beer doesn't demand caramel malt in everything. Ingredients: water, malt, ots, lactose, hops, passion fruit and mango aroma, vanilla and yeast. Contains gluten.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.124448	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
