23970	Single Hop Series - Galaxy	5441	India Pale Ale (IPA)	7.0	\N	The newest member of our Single Hop Series of IPAs features the Australian hop varietal – Galaxy! This is the second Australian hop we’ve used. Nelson Sauvin Single Hop IPA was released in early 2012, and turned out to be a very interesting and well-received IPA. Like other Australian varietals, Galaxy is creating quite a buzz with hop heads worldwide.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.124448	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
