23972	Single Hop Series - Amarillo	5441	India Pale Ale (IPA)	7.0	\N	West Coast in style and agressively hopped, this Single Hop IPA showcases 'Amarillo' and its sweet, bright, citrusy orange flavors. 7% ABV	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.124448	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
