24272	In The Dark We Live - Dark Fruits Edit	5443	Black IPA	9.0	\N	A classic gets a new edit.We’ve taken one of our favourite regular beers, In The Dark We Live, and given it a bit of a remix. A darker take on our Black IPA, we’ve added in blackcurrants, blackberries, and black raspberries to take In The Dark’s classic berry notes and turn them up to 11.On the nose, you get intense hops and plenty blackcurrant. But on the palate, the rich dark malts start to come through, with just a hint of acidity from the fruit and lots of resionous, juicy hop flavour. The fresh fruit flavours come through again in the finish, that play just right against an assertive bitterness.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
