24290	Attack Of The Killer Crab	5443	Double IPA	9.2	\N	Lurking in the murky depths is a terrifying beast ready to attack your tastebuds...Attack of the Killer Crab is the shocking sequel to our first Vermont Yeast starring double-feature, The Alligator Man. This time we've got Citra and Amarillo in the starring roles, and it's finally ready to be unleashed.Rinse out the awful taste of Khlav Kalash with our crab juice inspired Double IPA; intense and in your face on the nose with ripe, tropical hops, expect a big, juicy mouthfeel on the palate and a clean bitterness in the finish.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
24294	Powder Day Dipa	5443	Double IPA	8.7	\N	Grab a bottle and hit the slopes, it's time for another super fresh DIPA.Brewed on a snowy day in Scotland and released just in time for the Winter Olympics, Powder Day was brewed using lupulin powder, or cryo hops. This fairly recent way of processing hops gets rid of the chaff and leaves all the good stuff behind, resulting in a concentrated burst of aroma and flavour. And of course, we wanted to throw this into a big, juicy Double IPA, so if you're a fan of the style then you've got to try it.Expect big upfront tropical and stone fruit hop aroma, chased on the palate with a big mouthfeel, a huge amount of juciness, and intense tropical and citrus hop flavour. Round it off with a soft juicy bitterness in the finish and you've got yourself an awesome Double IPA.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
