24501	Daddy Warbucks	5445	Double IPA	9.8	\N	Previously 9%.Daddy Warbucks, (AKA Imperial Money) was originally inspired by our good friends at One Mile House in NYC who asked if we would brew an imperial version of their favorite Barrier beer to commemorate their second anniversary.  We obliged and the people rejoiced.  The beer was such a hit we decided we needed to brew it again, and so we did.  And the people rejoiced once more.  So here it is in all its hoppy glory, tucked safely inside this bottle just for you.  Share it with a friend and spread the wealth, or hoard it all for yourself you greedy bastard!  This is a big IPA loaded with perishable hops.  Drink it while it’s fresh.  We can always brew more.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
