26755	Guillotine	5469	India Pale Ale (IPA)	7.1	\N	The seventh beer in our 2018 hop-forward series, Guillotine is a brut IPA, a style that has recently emerged from the San Francisco bay area. This style uses extra amylase enzymes to promote a more complete fermentation of the sugars from the malt, giving a beer that is completely dry, hence the name ('brut' being a designation for the driest sparkling wine). To enhance the vinous character we have used Hallertau Blanc, Huell Melon, Nelson Sauvin & Motueka hops, giving tangy white grape and tropical fruit notes.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.15433	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
26756	Butterfly Guard	5469	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.5	\N	The ninth beer in our 2018 hop-forward series, Butterfly Guard is a contemporary-style IPA, featuring Enigma, Simcoe, Azacca and El Dorado hops. Brewed with protein grains and lactose to be soft and full-bodied, with moderate bitterness and lots of peach, tropical and zesty citrus fruit hop character.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.15433	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
