26945	Last Chance Ipa - Apricot	5471	India Pale Ale (IPA)	5.9	\N	We’ve decided to take our Last Chance IPA and add a little twist…We started with our 5.9% ABV Last Chance IPA, a full-flavored IPA with pungent aromas of grapefruit, pine and citrus which are produced by the combination of Centennial, Cascade, Simcoe® and Columbus hops. To that delightful brew, we’ve added apricots. Not just a few, but over 15 pounds of them per barrel!While the apricot is subtle on your first sip, it is certainly more noticeable after several sips. Due to the higher pectins of the apricot, this beer pours cloudy.Available NOW on draft only at The Tap Room, as well as select bars and restaurants throughout our distribution area!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.15433	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
