27055	Dank Tank Fresh Sticky Nugs (2017)	5472	Double IPA	8.0	\N	After 4 months of tilling and hoeing Farmer MacDanknugs was cockeyed with anticipation, ready to reap his reward of fresh sticky nugs. Filling up his supercharged John Beere, ol' MacDanknugs blazed straight down to plow some primo Amarillo, Citra, and Simcoe, harvesting the funkiest hops to cap off this succulent unfiltered 8% Double IPA. Our farmer drifted into a hoppy haze from the aromas of grapefruit, passionfruit and orange, daydreaming of the juicy brew to come.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.324333	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
