28179	Absolute Unit	5483	Double IPA	10.0	\N	We're in awe at the size of this Triple NEIPA -- Absolute Unit. The most bodacious entry yet in our Covalent Bond canned collaboration series, Absolute Unit was benched and brewed with the party wizards down at Modern Times! We've bulked up this beast with Mosaic, El Dorado, and Galaxy hops all the way through its production, beginning with an intense dry-hopping right at knockout. The resulting liquid explodes with overripe tropical fruit -- deep papaya and guava with a bite of bitter pineapple, with a finishing flex of subtle candied orange sweetness. Deep orange in hue with a silky-soft texture, this legend packs a formidable 10% ABV on an absolutely massive body.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.659413	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
