28227	Summer '18 No. 4	5484	India Pale Ale (IPA)	5.8	\N	The final of our Summer collaboration beers for 2018: a White IPA brewed with our friends Verdant and Unity!This beer is a nod to both our love of the original hazy beer Witbier - and new-world, juicy IPAs. Fermented with London Fog, the beer is smooth and peachy. The grist was loaded with wheat malt (35%), flaked wheat (10%), flaked oats (10%) and then was balanced out with continental Pils malt.Low in bitterness, but heavily dry-hopped, this beer used copious amounts of Idaho 7 and El Dorado, with a small touch of coriander in the brewhouse.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.659413	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
28246	Hoperation Overload	974	Double IPA	9.6	\N	An Our mission for this Imperial or ’Double’ India Pale Ale is to overload the beer with hops for an intense hop bitterness, flavor and aroma while still being balanced by a big malt profile, resulting in a hoppy beer with more dimension. This beer is light copper in color with some hop haze from overloading with dry hops as well. World Beer Championships Award: Bronze Medal 2011	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.659413	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
