29402	05/09 India Pale Ale - Vienna	5494	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.7	\N	Our 0509 IPA - Vienna 6.7% is a slight different take on an IPA. We use 95% Vienna barley malt that is kilned slightly longer to provide a bright red hue and a richer, fuller bodied finish. We have further enhanced the malty red fruit character with a blend of Mosaic, Citra, Simcoe, and Centennial hops from the US.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.996498	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
