29475	Local First	5495	India Pale Ale (IPA)	7.2	\N	Collaborating with another brewery is not only a great way to increase our creativity, it’s also an honor.  Especially when it is a fellow LOCAL brewery.  This collaBREWation with Lattitude 33 proved to be just that.  Being in Vista, we both wanted to brew that classic San Diego IPA that, well… when you take one sip is like a wrecking ball to the pallet.  And that is just what we did.  Bittered with Apollo hops and dry hopped with Falconer’s Flight and Chinook, this IPA is bold, bitter and big with notes of  grapefruit.  So when it comes to these hot summer days, follow your thirst and DRINK LOCAL FIRST!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.996498	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
