29958	Belsnickel	5501	India Pale Ale (IPA)	6.0	\N	(English Below) Belsnickel er i Cervisiam sin verden et juleøl inspirert av skapningen som legger humle i ganen din dersom du har vært slem når juletiden kommer. En IPA med en ren kropp og mye aromahumle for å hamle opp med fet julemat, uten å stjele hele showet.---------------------------------------Belsnickel is in Cervisiam’s world a Christmas beer inspired by the creature that shoves hops in your mouth when you’ve been naughty. An IPA with a clean body and ho-ho-hoppy enough to complement fatty Norwegian Christmas food, without stealing the whole show.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:50.156454	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
