21784	Sankaty Light Lager	5417	Lager	3.8	\N	Ed. Note:  Although this beer was originally an American Golden Ale, after a short period of time the brewer changed the yeast strain, and it is now a lager.  This 126 calorie lager with wonderful balance and strong hop finish is unlike most light beers. Reminiscent of an IPA but smooth and easy to drink.It is named after the famous lighthouse that has stood on a bluff on the south eastern side of Nantucket Island since 1849. Perched precariously 88 feet above the raging Atlantic Ocean, Sankaty Head Light is in danger of falling prey to beach erosion. The lighthouse is the most powerful in New England.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.450619	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
21804	Ocearch Shark Tracker Light Lager	5417	Lager	4.8	\N	Cisco Brewers and OCEARCH have teamed up to produce a beer which will benefit research and education on Apex predators of the ocean while inspiring fascination rather than fear.After months of planning, the OCEARCH Team of Chris Fischer, Brett McBride and global brand director Chris Berger along with the sampling team at Cisco Brewers, blind tasted 4 styles of beer and chose a light, clean, and crisp pilsner to be brewed as the Shark Tracker Light Lager. Perfect for any on-the-water activity. Like tracking sharks. 4.8% abv$3 from every case sold goes to OCEARCH in support of their education and outreach program.Currently distributed in: Massachusetts, Maine, Rhode Island, Connecticut, New York, Illinois, and California.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.450619	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
21970	Gradisca	797	Lager	5.2	\N	(ITA) Chiara, 100% malto d'orzo, dal colore dorato e bella schiuma candita. Un perfetto equilibrio fra note floreali e fragranti di luppolo, di malto e miele. E' la più desiderata, di facile approccio e grande soddisfazione, gusto ben bilanciato e pulito, invoglia subito il secondo sorso. /// - Schiuma bianca fine, compatta, abbastanza persistente. - Oro brillante. - Gradevole la sua finezza olfattiva, che rivela sentori di erbaceo secco, fieno, e note di frutta gialla, note di malto delicatamente biscottato. - La frizzantezza è leggermente sopra la media. Si equilibra correttamente con il corpo leggero. - In bocca il tipico sentore di orzo, un carezzevole miele balsamico che contribuisce a donarle una notevole freschezza, un amaro decisamente moderato. - Una birra lager pulita, dall'equilibrio gustativo tendente al dolce del malto d'orzo. Plato 12.5°  (ENG) Pale, 100% barley malt, golden in colour and with a fine white head. A perfect balance between floral notes and the fragrances of hops, malt and honey. The cherished object of desire, the easiest to get close to, and the giver of great satisfactions, with a clean and well-balanced taste, as the first sip immediately invites the second to follow. ///- White, compact and persistent foam. - Bright gold color. - Elegant and pleasing aroma, it reveals hints of dry herbs and yellow fruit, topped by malty and gentle biscuit notes. - The carbonation is slightly above average and it is balanced properly with the lightweight body. - In the mouth the hint of barley, a balsamic honey which helps to give it a remarkable freshness, a moderate bitterness. - Not very rich aftertaste, as rightly expected by most of the bottom-fermented beers. A clean, sweetish to malty lager beer. Plato 12.5°	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.450619	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574216364975-51fcb7fffd8e?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
