10467	Nocturna	462	Oatmeal Stout	5.4	\N	Birra nera ad alta fermentazione, non pastorizzata, non filtrata e rifermentata in bottiglia. Senza aggiunta di anidride carbonica, stabilizzanti e conservanti. Prodotta con fiocchi d’avena, malti d’orzo di differenti tostature e con una piccola percentuale di malti affumicati essiccati sopra fuochi di legno di faggio. Servire in un bicchiere svasato con abbondante schiuma.\n\nL’unica birra prodotta seguendo un vero e proprio stile l’Oatmeal Stout (entra nella categoria delle dry-stout per la sua facile beva e il tenore alcolico attenuato 5.4. Birra scura con l’avena “Oatmeal” che contribuisce ad ammorbidire il prodotto). Una leggera percentuale di malti affumicati donano una sensazione fumè molto delicata.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.383763	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
10528	Spray-Tan Gone Wrong	464	Milk/Sweet Stout	6.5	\N	You know him, the guy who listens one song too long in the tanning salon. Or that girl who worships the faux sun gods. Every city has one: a person addicted to the glow. Spray-Tan Gone Wrong is our ode to the streak free sun freaks that believe airbrushed orange is the new gorgeous. This orange milk stout is an instant bronzer that offers up a zestful kick that to all those hard-to-reach areas. Like a good tanning spray, is glides easy and absorbs quickly. Unlike the spray, you can enjoy it without rubber gloves. Juist...! De Spray-tan gone wrong! Een sinaasappel mikstout van 6,5% En dit keer hebben we alles behalve zuinig gedaan met de sinaasappel. Begin koken, einde koken, whirlpool en in de gisting! Een flinke beuker met zoetig romig smaak. En dan een bek vol sinaasappel! Oh en tussen de flessen zitten er 2 met een sticker.... Heb jij die fles met de sticker? HA! Dan krijg je van ons een gratis ’’Spray-tan!’’ En mail ons een foto van jou met de fles!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.383763	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
