20219	Boris Batch #100	5386	Imperial Stout	9.4	\N	BORIS #100 was made with the finest English Pale Ale malt instead of our usual American malt, to celebrate brewing the 100th. batch of BORIS The Crusher Oatmeal-Imperial Stout.  This adds a slightly sweeter and truly traditional flavor for this truly bodacious English-style Imperial Stout, our flagship beer!  Made in extremely limited quantites.Has a blue cap.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20221	Barrel Aged Boris Van Wink	5386	Imperial Stout	9.4	\N	Aged in very special Kentucky whiskey barrels to add a super smooth, buttery, and complex whiskey character to our multi-award winning BORIS The Crusher Oatmeal Imperial Stout. Richer and bolder than our standard Bourbon Barrel Aged BORIS Stout, this rare version is a testament to our hard work and dedication in bringing our customers the very best.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20222	/ Cigar City Daredevils Got Game	5386	Imperial Stout	10.4	\N	When brewing daredevils like us get together for a collaboration brew, we often want to spread our wings, reaching into the depths of our minds to come up with an idea for a beer that is ground-breaking. That’s how DareDevils Got Game was invented,  a robust Imperial Stout complemented by hints of fresh-roasted coffee beans and the unique character of Italian black brewer’s licorice for a wonderful complexity great depth of flavor.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20223	/ Lervig Sippin' Into Darkness	5386	Imperial Stout	12.0	\N	Collaborating with Lervig Aktiebryggeri in Norway, we designed this Chocolate Martini Imperial Stout to be rich and tasty, with the inviting flavors of a chocolate martini. Using layers of caramel malt and Belgian chocolate malt along with cocoa and other spices, Hoppin’ Frog brewmaster Fred Karm along with Lervig brewmaster Mike Murphy created Sippin’ Into Darkness - a recipe that will stand the test of time, and can be enjoyed for years to come. We truly hope you enjoy this flavorful masterpiece that captures our vision and creativity. Cheers!!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20224	/ Amager  Hops From Amager	5386	Imperial Stout	7.8	\N	This is the 3rd. Collaboration Brew from this year’s European Tour Series, and was developed with Amager Brewery in Copenhagen, Denmark. At 7.8% abv, it is rich, hoppy and balanced. Frog Hops is made with an abundance of English and German malts, including the super-tasty German chocolate malt! And it is hopped with select American hops, including dry-hopping. Check-out the video of us brewing FROG HOPS at Amager Bryghus in Copenhagen, at http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x4sWtCzOaWI	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20225	Rum Barrel Aged Boris The Crusher	5386	Imperial Stout	9.4	\N	Aged in select rum barrels to add extra sizzle to the flavor of our multi-award-winning BORIS The Crusher oatmeal-imperial stout. The lively, spicy character of the rum barrel creates a wonderful, crisper overall taste compared to our standard Bourbon Barrel Aged BORIS stout. This is a great twist on our most popular barrel-aged beer!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20287	Even More Jesus	5388	Imperial Stout	12.0	\N	Few times in the history of craft beer it has happened that a highly praised beer rises beyond mortal stardom into a higher godly league. Usually the recipe to make such heavenly drops is thick fudge-like body, pitch black color, amazingly overwhelming aromas of chocolate, coffee, dark fruits and muscovado sugar, obviously only made in limited amounts and most crucial of all – it must taste rare!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20226	Barrel Aged Toris The Tyrant	5386	Imperial Stout	13.8	\N	Bourbon Barrel Aged StoutTriple Oatmeal Russian Imperial Stout This super-tasty Triple Oatmeal Russian Imperial Stout is rich, dark and flavorful - the way we like it - this beer is intense! Reaching a whole new level of taste, a wonderful complexity and depth is imparted from aging in select Bourbon barrels. Rich flavors and aromas of oak, vanilla & whiskey abound, to perfectly compliment the intense character of T.O.R.I.S.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20230	Extended Barrel Aged Boris The Crusher	5386	Imperial Stout	9.4	\N	Super-deep, rich flavors from long aging in select Woodford Reserve Bourbon barrels beautifully complement the character of BORIS, our original imperial stout. Intense flavors and aromas of oak, toasted vanilla, butter, and fine tobacco from barrel aging 5 times longer, just like BORIS 200, lend an immensely satisfying depth to this deep roasted and full bodied stout.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20234	Bourbon Barrel Aged Sippin' Into Darkness	5386	Imperial Stout	12.0	\N	Aging in bourbon barrels takes this collaboration to Lervig Aktiebryggeri in Norway to a whole new level! The inviting bourbon barrel and oak characters are a wonderful addition to this chocolate martini imperial stout, enhancing the flavors of caramel and Belgian chocolate malt along with the cocoa and vanilla. Lervig’s head brewer Mike Murphy and I created this recipe that will stand the test of time and can be enjoyed for years to come. This flavorful masterpiece truly captures our vision and creativity.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20240	Barrel Aged Boris The Crusher Reserve	5386	Imperial Stout	9.4	\N	Refined version of our BORIS Imperial Stout aged in select whiskey barrels for a richer, wonderfully complex, and mature flavor. BORIS Reserve is brewed with even better dark grain - the finest imported dark grain - for a smoother and mellower deep-roasted malt flavor. It is a higher level of BORIS born from our creativity, and when aged in barrels is an amazing symphony of beautiful flavors.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20243	Cleveland Crusher	5386	Imperial Stout	9.4	\N	Based on our BORIS The Crusher Oatmeal-Imperial Stout, but made with Belgian chocolate malt instead of roasted barley.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20251	Boris The Crusher Grand Reserve	5386	Imperial Stout	9.4	\N	When you care to drink the very best, this is the pinnacle of flavor, and our most refined Imperial Stout.  Traditionally reserved for immediate friends and family, we carry on the Grand Reserve practice by selecting the ultra-finest base malt from England and chocolate malt from Belgium.  These superior, world-class malts take B.O.R.I.S. to a whole new level - Grand Reserve level	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20255	Maple Whiskey Barrel Aged Boris	5386	Imperial Stout	9.4	\N	Amazing maple and whiskey barrel characters beautifully complement the roasty, toasty and caramelized flavors of our renowned B.O.R.I.S. Imperial Stout. This beer was aged in very special and rare maple-staved barrels that once held an iconic Canadian whiskey. It was aged with flavorful amber Canadian maple sap, and maple-toasted oak chips. The result is magnificent.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20276	Vinnamon Sin	5386	Imperial Stout	9.4	\N	The BORIS was racked by the brewers with care, with dreams of vanilla soon they would share. Our brewers were weaving the barrels like threads, while fractals of cinnamon danced in their heads. Stout aged in superb Canadian cinnamon-vanilla whiskey barrels.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20327	No Hero	5388	Stout	7.0	\N	An alien-like outsider, always flirting with oddity and exploring anxiety and paranoia. A style chameleon, a wonderful labyrinth and truly a transcendent genius. It’s impossible not to idolize out of proportion. This is a stout. It may not be a hero, but it’s attractive, clever and hungry for stardom.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20286	Imperial Biscotti Break	5388	Imperial Stout	11.5	\N	The Roman Empire had a certain “je ne sais quoi” festive food culture, extravagant architecture and spectacular live entertainment. Some might argue the Emperors were brutal, mad and hungry for power, and the people vain when taking baths and working out all day. Listen – that’s still all part of the secret Imperial ingredient – keep it cool, clean, confident, arrogant and flamboyant. Forza Imperiale.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
