29063	Boris Imperial Stout (2014) - Bourbon Barrel	5491	Imperial Stout	9.5	\N	Swift & silent, owl glides through the dark, his screech believed to portend death & misfortune. Some revere him as a messenger of the spirit world, an oracle of secret knowledge. Inspired by owl’s omniscience this barrel-aged stout penetrates the only depths of the soul, illuminating unseen truths. A collaboration with Brasserie Trois Dames in Nov 2014, this was one of our very first brews & has aged in bourbon barrels ever since, developing a deep, dark, rich smoothness & leathery aroma.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.996498	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
