29917	Grako	1018	Imperial Stout	9.0	\N	Birra scura in stile Imperial Stout non pastorizzata con fave di cacao aggiunte al mash. Prodotta con metodo craft esclusivamente con materie prime naturali, senza additivi e conservanti. Il leggero deposito non è da considerarsi un difetto ma la normale sedimentazione del lievito dovuto alla rifermentazione in bottiglia. Piacevole in bocca con caffè, cioccolato e toffee. Servire a 10 - 12° C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, avena, fave di cacao, luppolo, zucchero in rifermentazione, lievito.Italy’s Best Imperial Stout Award in 2016 @ World Beer Awards. Imperial Stout, unpasteurized with cocoa added to the mash beans. Produced by craft method exclusively from natural raw materials, without additives and preservatives. The lightweight deposit is not considered a defect, but normal due to the sedimentation of yeast fermentation in the bottle. Pleasant in the mouth with coffee, chocolate and toffee. Serve at 10 - 12° C. Ingredients: water, malted barley, oats, cocoa beans, hops, sugar refermentation, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:50.156454	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1572490122747-3968b75cc699?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
