20501	God Save The Pils	5394	Pilsner	4.8	\N	We at Arcadia have always strived to stay connected to our British-inspired, American-crafted roots since our establishment in 1996. A fine example of this commitment can be seen, felt and tasted in our newest collaboration beer: God Save the Pils!The origins of this partnership started with a visit to the medieval market town of Faversham in Kent, England, home of the storied Battle of Britain. There we met the Master Brewers of Shepherd Neame, the oldest brewer in England, where art and science has been blended into award-winning, world-class beers since 1698. Together we sought to design a beer that is respectful to our brewing traditions, yet unique in its execution. The result – Arcadia’s first ever lager beer. This unfiltered Pilsner-style beer is loaded with hops from the “Garden of England”, the name given to the famed Hop Yards of Kent, and brewed with 100% English malted barley.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566919317267-b5e1b2bb2b15?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566919317267-b5e1b2bb2b15?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20786	Brewers' Collection Imperial Pilsner	5399	Imperial Pilsner	7.2	\N	Meantime Imperial Pilsner derives its fresh and vibrant aroma and taste from the use of Sorachi Ace hops from Japan. The intense citrus fruit flavour is complemented by the firm malt body of East Anglian two-row spring barley and higher than usual levels of alcohol that gives the beer its name.The inspiration for this beer comes from the hoppier North German Pilsner beers and the intensely hopped Pale Ales of Southern California. The use of light but rich malts, extremely soft water and a yeast that ferments at very low temperature gives the Sorachi Ace hop the opportunity to shine ’centre stage’ in this single hop varietal beer.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.120099	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566919317267-b5e1b2bb2b15?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566919317267-b5e1b2bb2b15?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
