728	The Otter (Mosaic-Centennial)	140	Pale Ale	5.0	\N	In recent years our friends from the UK have found awesome ways to build on their rich tradition while incorporating modern influences from across the pond.The Otter is our tribute to these beers (and the breweries that make them). A Pale Ale series that is both exciting and very pintable. The base is as english as you can get, with 100% Marris Otter malts and Fullers yeast. The (dry)hop is abundant and will change with each batch.This debut is a feast of the extravagant tropical fruitiness of Mosaic with the Citrus-y twist of Centennial.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-21 23:19:28.814704	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
