2524	Unfiltered Sour Hop Ale	196	Belgian Ale	0.0	\N	Served at Belgium Comes to Cooperstown, 8/2/08.  Amber-style beer fermented with Brettanomyces and dry-hopped with Ahtanum hops.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.361767	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
