3699	Cali	5218	American Pale Ale (APA)	5.6	\N	The juiciest, tastiest, most delicious IPAs and Pale Ales are of the West Coast style, using the fruity, spicy, resinous hops from the beautiful west coast of America. From Washington State in the north, through beer-mad Oregon, to the Golden State which inspired the name for our new beer – Cali.That’s right, we’ve brewed a West Coast APA packed full of juicy fruit notes and big hop resins. It’s like drinking sunshine, palm trees, good surfing and Hollywood.Think 90210 comes to NP20. Goldie Hawn meets Goldie Lookin’ Chain. Newport Beach via Newport, Gwent.We’ve packed this Hollywood superstar full of Mosaic, Simcoe and a new hop in our brewhouse. Equinox brings an amazing blend of sweet tropical fruit notes and earthy wood qualities that combine with Mosaic and Simcoe for great depth of flavour.Cali will be coming to you from January in bottle and on keg, so keep an eye out in all good bars and bottle shops	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.915778	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
