3704	Juicy	5218	Golden Ale / Blond Ale	4.8	\N	Tropical Golden Ale.Ever had a beer that’s so good, it reminds you of when you were a kid? Of the wonder of the sweet shop, surrounded by a seemingly endless choice of delicious confections?Do you choose gummy worms or jelly teddy bears, or both?! Be transported by this, the most delicious golden ale, filled with the juiciest hops we could find - offering nearly as many mouth-watering flavours as those countless sweetie jars stacked high above your head years ago.So moreish, so tasty, so JUICY.    IBU: 30,     OG: 1.046 (11.5°P),      Hops: American,      Released: August 2016, Cask.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.915778	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
3715	You Snows It	5218	American Pale Ale (APA)	4.7	\N	Christmas time is a time for cheer, so we’ve got together with the cheeriest bunch we know to brew a very cheery Christmas ale!You Snows It is our second collaboration with Newport’s finest, Goldie Lookin’ Chain!There are no gimmicks with this super pale Christmas Ale. It’s brewed as light as the first snow, with Super Pale and Carapils malt, then hopped so it’s as crisp as Christmas morning with Waimea from New Zealand and the rich fruit flavours from UK grown Olicana.The result is a super light, easy drinking beer with lots of aroma and just a little bit of bitterness. Just like that uncle that always seems to ruin your Christmas dinner.2016 - Cask, 4.2%2017 - Keg & bottle, 4.7%	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.915778	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
3731	Fugg Life	5218	Golden Ale / Blond Ale	4.2	\N	Fugg Life.Brit PA.British hops like Fuggles may not be trendy like their American cousins, but they live the Fugg Life. Our Brit PA is wholly hopped using British hops. Rather than the fruity, citrussy flavours imparted by American and Pacific hops, their British cousins give an earthy, woody flavour that makes for perfect bittering. An easy drinking 4.2% pale ale, Fugg Life delivers a rich bitterness before a clean, dry finish.    IBU: 40,    OG: 1.040 (10°P),     Hops: British,      Released: June 2016.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.915778	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
