3745	/ Dugges Pina Colada Pale Ale	5218	American Pale Ale (APA)	5.7	\N	If you like Pina Colada (but not necessarily getting caught in the rain) then you are going to love our new collaboration brew!Our Pina Colada Pale Ale has been brewed in collaboration with the wonderful Dugges in sunny, tropical Landvetter, Sweden! That’s about 15km away from Gothenburg, or 730 miles away from sunny Newport.Alright, Sweden isn’t really tropical – and neither is Newport. But with the nights getting colder and darker we thought it would be great to brew something to remind us of summer holidays to come.The beer has a creamy texture and the sweet and sharp pineapple hit that makes a Pina Colada what it is. At 5.7% ABV, it’s no mocktail either.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.915778	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
