5340	Chocolate Covered Black Angel	5233	Sour / Wild Ale	6.6	\N	This variation on our flagship sour, Black Angel, is aged in Kentucky bourbon barrels. After the beer rests in barrels, we then blend in steel tanks with over 2 pounds per gallon of tart Montgomery cherries and copious amounts of Honduran cacao nibs from French Broad Chocolates.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.485546	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
5341	Puzzle Pieces	5233	Sour / Wild Ale	6.7	\N	Autism affects 1 in 68 children and is the fastest-growing developmental disorder in the U.S. and yet, only represents .55% of the National Institutes of Health Funds Allocation. This unique blend of barrels was crafted to shed light on the countless untold stories of these children. A portion of the proceeds from this bottle will go toward benefiting the work of the Autism Society of North Carolina. Thank you for support and cheers to the beauty and uniqueness of each puzzle piece.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.485546	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
