6208	Who You Gonna Call?	5241	Traditional Ale	4.4	\N	Reviving a traditional German style with our friends from Truman's brewery, we've brewed this 4.4% Kottbusser style beer with barley, wheat, oats, honey, Jaggery (traditional cane sugar) and Grüngeist hops. Drinks like a sweeter, smoother, nuttier altbier.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.839507	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
