6367	Jalapenos Raspberry Double	333	Belgian Ale	6.5	\N	Raphael Mettler met Peter and Heather Dickson at Six Point. Peter is a tattoo aficionado. That’s why he visits Sainte-Croix regularly and stays with the Leu family. On the occasion of Peter’s 2013 trip, we decided to brew a beer, here in Switzerland,   following a Six Point Brewery recipe, with the proviso that the beer be aged in oak barrels for a year. The result is a double-ale-type Belgian beer with jalapenos and fermented raspberries.   It will be exported to the USA but will also be available in Switzerland in October 2014.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.839507	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
