6940	American Pale Ale	364	American Pale Ale (APA)	5.5	\N	Birra ad alta fermentazione con luppoli pregiati ed aromatici. Colore oro antico. Gusto asciutto con note erbacee, fruttate, di banana e di frutta esotica. Schiuma bianca e compatta. Servire a 8 - 10° C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, luppolo, lievito. West Coast American Pale Ale. Top-fermented beer with rich and aromatic hops. Antique gold color. Dry taste with herbaceous, banana and exotic fruit notes. White and compact foam. Serve at 8 - 10° C. Ingredients: water, barley malt, hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.026848	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
6941	Borbonica Red	365	Belgian Ale	7.0	\N	Birra doppio malto ad alta fermentazione prodotta con metodo artigianale con ingredienti naturali, stile trappista con ottimo bilanciamento del dolce. Non pastorizzata, non filtrata, rifermentata e affinata in bottiglia. È una birra da tutto pasto che predilige formaggi e salumi. Servire a 8 - 9° C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d'orzo, zucchero candito, luppolo, lievito.High fermentation beer produced with the artisanal method with natural ingredients, trappist style with excellent sweet balancing. Unpasteurized, unfiltered, refermented and refined in the bottle. It is a full-course beer that prefers cheese and salami. Serve at 8 - 9° C. Ingredients: water, barley malt, sugar candy, hops, yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.026848	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
6943	Borbonica Gold	365	Golden Ale / Blond Ale	6.5	\N	Birra doppio malto ad alta fermentazione prodotta con metodo artigianale con ingredienti naturali. Non pastorizzata, non filtrata, rifermentata e affinata in bottiglia. Si abbina in modo speciale a piatti forti e speziati, ma anche a carni rosse, salumi e formaggi. Servire a 10 - 15° C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d'orzo, farro, luppolo, lievito, buccia di arancia dolce, cannella, coriandolo, anice stellato.High fermentation beer produced with the artisanal method with natural ingredients. Not pasteurized, unfiltered, refermented and refined in the bottle. It goes particularly well with strong and spicy dishes, but also with red meats, cured meats and cheeses. Serve at 10 - 15° C. Ingredients: water, barley malt, spelled, hops, yeast, sweet orange peel, cinnamon, coriander, star anise.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.026848	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
