7278	Pricklish	5250	Sour / Wild Ale	6.1	\N	A blend of golden sours aged in oak barrels with prickly pears, Pricklish is bound to amuse your senses!In order to showcase the delicate flavors of prickly pear, we added a ton of pureed prickly pears to a 4 oak barrel blend that was fermented with a mixture of Brettanomyces and Saccharomyces yeast and soured with Lactobacillus and Pediococcus bacteria. Pricklish features a mild acidity with flavors of earthy pear, melon, and crisp grapes. We’re just prickled pink with how this beer turned out.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.22296	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
