7309	Tropical Humor	5250	Sour / Wild Ale	5.6	\N	Dreaming about soaking up some sun on a remote island in the tropics? So are we… which is why we added tons of fresh pineapple to enhance the undertones of pineapple already present in this golden sour beer. Tropical Humor, a golden sour beer aged in oak barrels with fresh pineapples, is bursting with flavors of sweet, juicy pineapple and tart lemon juice. It’s almost funny just how much this golden sour will make you feel like you are sippin’ on pineapple punch in the Caribbean.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.22296	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
