7940	Pulling Nails Blend #2	5256	Sour / Wild Ale	6.0	\N	Pulling Nails is an ongoing experiment in the art of blending to create sour and wild ales of extraordinary depth, complexity and balance. Blend #2 is the union of some of our favorite spontaneous, wild and sour blond beers that were fermented in and aged in wine barrels for three months to two and a half years.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
7941	Foedre Beer	5256	Sour / Wild Ale	6.0	\N	One of our two regular cask offerings. Called 'Foedre Beer' after the large wooden vessel used to age it, it is a sour blond beer which also serves at the base for a few of our popular releases like 'Fuzzy' and 'Fencerow.' Replicating the way traditional Lambics are served in Belgium, it is served flat, hand-pulled from the foedre as often as possible, and fruit is occasionally added to the cask.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
