8261	Oh Yeaahh!! Electric Blue Kettle Sour Ale With Flavoring	5257	Sour / Wild Ale	3.5	\N	Dare we say our Oh Yeaahh!! Electric Blue Kettle Sour tastes blue? Like the kind of mouth-staining, mixed berry blue we loved as kids. It pours a hazy teal with a pillowy, cotton candy head. Waves of pineapple and honeydew melon on the nose draw you in. On the palate, tart raspberry, boysenberry, and some of that pineapple and melon from the aroma bring a bursting juiciness that tastes like the sticky, childhood nostalgia at the center of a Fruit Gusher. Oh Yeaahh!! is a fun Kettle Sour with a Sweet Tart sugary prickliness, and at 3.5% ABV, you can sip it all day long like a juice box.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.622897	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
