8864	Rosy Barl	5265	Sour / Wild Ale	5.4	\N	We filled a handful of local Chardonnay “barls” with our Mowkeef Saison, then added fresh raspberries along with our proprietary “wild” culture and allowed the marriage of flavors to begin. After 14 months and dozens of barrel tastings, we found what we were looking for: soft aromas of raspberry and dried fruits, a refreshingly tart finish, and a “rosy” glow.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.796861	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
