9755	Gar The Duo Spruce Tip Cuvée	5274	Sour / Wild Ale	6.0	\N	An elegant blend of multiple years of spontaneously inoculated and barrel fermented golden wild ale aged in local Gin barrels. This blend was chosen for its notable complexity, balanced yet characterful barrel notes and emphatic Brettanomyces character. After blending, this was conditioned on local Spruce tips hand-picked from our beautiful forests by our brewery team. When picked in the narrow window of ideal time, the tips present a crisp citrus character in addition to the expected presentation of their ‘foresty’ origins. In the beer, they provide an aroma of freshly macerated blackberries, citrus and spruce to complement the botanical nature of the Gin barrels. Extensive conditioning in bottle has provided a vibrant carbonation and a bold funk.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.195048	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
