11571	Acbw Red Rye Ale	5291	Amber Ale	6.4	\N	We’ve been asked countless times, 'When will you guys brew the Redlands 125th Anniversary Red again?' Well, we figured it was time.We took that popular recipe and added Rye into the malt bill, giving a nice spicy, crackery malt character to supplement the citrus, floral and pine aromas of the dry hopping. We’re calling it our Red Rye Ale... though if you accidentally call it 'Redlands Red 2.0' we won’t blame you.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.944228	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
