11609	Little Bastard Ale	5292	Amber Ale	4.7	\N	Consider this Arrogant Bastard’s identical little brother, just as aggressive in nature but slightly less so in dominance. While it packs less of a punch to your ego, the unworthy are still, well, UNWORTHY.If one were to ponder why we might brew a beer that’s less flame-throwingly hot than its bigger brother, perhaps this will slake your curiosity: We promised to never brew beer that pandered to the lowest common denominator, and we haven’t here. However, we never promised we wouldn’t pander to the various national alcohol control boards who outlaw higher ABVs, if the result means putting liquid arrogance where it belongs–in your hand. Cheers to me!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.944228	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
