12818	Dreamsicle Orange Vanilla Pale Ale	5305	American Pale Ale (APA)	4.1	\N	Designed by the brewing staff and Head Brewer Patrick Howell, this one-of-a-kind summer treat is unlike any beer you’ve ever tried before. Brewed with orange peel, natural vanilla extract and lactose sugar, the beer combines citrus and ice-cream notes with the classic American Pale Ale base. “This beer is my childhood summer memories in liquid form,” said Howell. “Eating a melting popsicle on the front porch on a warm summer night, that was the idea we had when designing this beer.”	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:44.316389	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
