12845	/ Sawdust City 11/05 2017 Imperial Fruit Sour	5305	Sour / Wild Ale	11.0	\N	Remember, Remember, The Sour of November. That’s how we think the rhyme should go, anyway. Sure, November 5th is Guy Fawkes Day, but for those of us in Ontario, 11/05 is synonymous with one of the most-anticipated beer releases of the year. That’s because brewmasters and birthday buddies Ryan Morrow (Nickel Brook) and Sam Corbeil (Sawdust City) have a tradition of brewing up some pretty insane high-octane beers and releasing them on their shared birthday. This year is no different, and 11.05 (2017) is ready to drop in our Bottle Shop this Sunday at 11am! This year’s brew: an Imperial Fruit Sour with Soursop. Soursop “We’ve really been working on a lot of great sours here at Nickel Brook, so we wanted to bring that into the mix this year” says Morrow. “Getting to 11% just means lots more malt and a bit of added sugar (dextrose), and then Sam had the idea of using this Soursop fruit which gives the beer a really unique tropical flavor and creamy mouthfeel.”	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:44.316389	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
12846	/ Ellicottville  Only Nerds Would Know	5305	Sour / Wild Ale	4.9	\N	Only Nerds Would Know is a Sour Hopfenweisse (or a Sour, Hoppy, Wheat Beer for you non-nerds) brewed in collaboration with our friends at Ellicottville Brewing Co. This tasty brew has a Wheated backbone, rounded out with a hint of banana and bubblegum. A touch of sour cuts the sweetness of the style, and a generous dryhopping with French Barbe Rouge hops provides a prominent strawberry brightness.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:44.316389	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
12847	In A Galaxy Far, Far Away	5305	Sour / Wild Ale	5.9	\N	Funk Lab 2018 Series: Release No.4 This galactic beauty illuminates with a straw yellow colour, and pale haze. Bright tropical notes of pineapple and citrus dance in the aroma (most likely to the Cantina theme song). Fresh stone fruit flavours are met with a surprisingly tart and refreshing finish that will kick your tastebuds into lightspeed and enter hyperspace.Our Galaxy here at Nickel Brook relies heavily on our hardworking Brewing and Production team. The force is strong with these ones, and so we have placed them on our labels as both heroes and villains for Star Wars day. Collect all four, or choose your favourite, but know this; the fate of the galaxy is in your hands now.May the Fourth be with you.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:44.316389	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
