15464	Big Walt Beer	5329	Golden Ale / Blond Ale	5.0	\N	We’ve teamed up with St. Louis Blues Hall of Famer Keith Tkachuk to bring you our BIG winter classic beer.Keith is an American-born hockey legend who scored 538 goals and over 1000 points in his NHL career.  He spent much of his time with the St. Louis Blues and still calls St. Louis home.  His aggressive style of play and ability to put points on the board made Keith the premiere power forward of his day and earned him an affectionate nickname, Big Walt.O’Fallon’s Big Walt Beer is, well, BIG.  We call the huge 22-ounce bottle a bomber for a reason – it’s BIG!  And the Big Walt Bomber will be another power player for you this hockey season.  Consumers will beat down the doors to grab one of these easy-drinking bombers or an ice-cold draught.  The big bottle features Keith’s lucky number 7, signature blue jersey, and replica autograph.  It’s a great beer for any sports fan or beer lover.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.252128	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
