17017	Hamilton'S Smooth Pub Ale	5347	Bitter Ale	0.0	\N	Collaboration brew between Hamilton’s Tavern in San Diego and Shipyard.A recipe with the mindset of English Pub ales like Boddingtons, John Smith Smooth, Tetleys and sent Denno (general manager Dennis borlek) to Shipyard (Maine) and he helped brew this tasty Pub Ale. Our house English style Pub Ale uses a not so typical pub ale hop profile--Simcoe/Amarillo hop by design the result is a very smooth, highly drinkable ale with just a slight hint of citrus hop on the finish.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:45.764883	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
