17953	La Vida Improvisacion	5359	Sour / Wild Ale	5.9	\N	The changing from Spring to Summer has done a number on many hearts. The yearly bloom of trees and flowers call out to our human nature inspiring love to grow between two special people, and their many animals. To honor this ever present love Jolly Pumpkin is releasing La Vida Improvisaciòn as an anniversary gift to Laurie Jeffries, the Chief Squeegee Operator Wrangler.This dry hopped oak aged sour saison is rich and resplendent with hoppy tropical fruit notes, full of liliko’l, papaya, mango and apricot. La Vida Improvisacion will be released at the pubs tomorrow June 11th, following it will be available in both 750ml bottles and on draught throughout the nation.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.105645	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
