19187	/ Jester King Cygnet	5373	Sour / Wild Ale	5.2	\N	Foedre-aged Wild Ale with Koji addedGravity: 10.5 PMalts: Pils, Vienna, Flaked Wheat, Fancy RiceHops: MagnumSecret Ingredients: Koji inoculated rice, Jester King x Off Color Mixed Cultures, Pair Bonding(from label)If you’d like to read more on this new line of packaging, check out October 25’s Chicago Tribune article (http://www.chicagotribune.com/dining/ct-food-off-color-8-ounce-bottles-20181025-story.html).(from http://www.offcolorbrewing.com/releases)	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.608724	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
19191	/ Jester King / Side Project / Central State / Allagash Miscellanea	5373	Sour / Wild Ale	6.0	\N	Name: Off Color / Jester King / Side Project / Central State / Allagash Miscellanea Vol 1 Foedre Fermented Wild Ale Secret Techniques: An ever evolving collection of wild yeasts, barrel lees and mixed cultures from ourselves and our dearest friends added to a single foedre and left to mingle. (from label) From John: This first release, Miscellanea Vol 1 is a tiger hued American Wild Ale with bugs, house bretts, native yeasts and wild cultures from Jester King, Side Project, Central State, Allagash and ourselves. By collecting all these yeasts it's almost the opposite to the letter of spontaneous fermentation but we're thinking of it regardless as homage to the sorts of lambics that led many of us down this path in the first place. Ridiculously complex with over-rippened apricot, bergamot, cotton candy, old growth forest floor, and wisps of Nebbiolo grapes from the foedre itself. Alluringly tannic and dry complemented by moderate acidity and Hanssen's Oude Gueze like, unabashed barnyard funk.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.608724	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
