20473	Amber Ale	5394	Amber Ale	5.8	\N	Arcadia introduces the newest addition to its stable of world class British-style ales. Brewed with the legendary Maris Otter Malt from Scotland, this beer is full-bodied and brings a taste of sweet caramel together with a hint of toasted malt that’s well balenced with a solid presence of premium American aromatic flower leaf hops. From the package: 'Then let us toast John Barleycorn, Each man a glass in hand; And may his great posterity ne’er fail in old Scotland!'	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
20480	Battle Creek Special Reserve	5394	Pale Ale	4.7	\N	Our lightest ale, Battle Creek Special reserve is an English Golden Mild. The lightly toasted, semisweet, malt character finishes crisp and is balanced by a mild hop bitterness and delicate Cascade hop nose.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:46.949817	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
