21414	Progress Limited Edition	5404	Strong Ale	10.0	\N	In celebration of 20 years of brewing we have lovingly crafted a rich and pure single hopped, 4% abv, cask ale with the trademark classic black sheep dry and bitter finish. We wanted to create a special limited edition version of this beer and at 10% abv, this is the definitive version of that ale. It is expertly brewed using only full flower English progress hops, maris otter malted barley and pure dales water. We use a touch of wheat which helps deliver the lovely creamy head and lacing down the glass - just what you would expect from a proper Yorkshire beer!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.2812	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
21415	Blitzen (Cask)	5404	Bitter Ale	4.0	\N	Complex Ruby Ale - Available in December '17. This Christmas, put down the sherry and pour yourself a glass of Blitzen instead. This cheeky little festive number is made with cascade and goldings hops, orange and mixed peels. A real winter warmer, apart from good friends and family,	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.2812	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
21416	Monty Python'S Life Of Brian (Bottled)	5404	Golden Ale / Blond Ale	3.9	\N	Witness the Birth of Brian, a very naughty Pale Ale!This November sees the launch of our brand new, official Monty Python Christmas beer, Brian. This ‘naughty’ pale ale will be our second collaborative beer with the legendary Python team, as we add it to the Black Sheep portfolio alongside its big brother Holy Grail!We’ve worked with the Python team for a long time, ever since we first brewed the ever-prevalent Holy Grail with them back in 1999, so we can’t wait to see our latest Monty themed beer sitting on bars across the UK this Christmas! Brian is the ale embodiment of the hugely popular, cult classic film ‘Monty Python’s Life of Brian’ which was released back in 1979. The beer was named following a Facebook vote amongst Monty Python’s 1.2 million followers. You wanted Brian and we delivered! The Python team added the lines ‘A Christmas Beer They Call…’ and ‘A Very Naughty Pale Ale’ after the legend that is Michael Palin, had said: “I’d quite like to see ‘naughty’ on a beer bottle”.Brian is a 3.9% Pale Ale for those who are looking for something light and fresh over the Christmas period. It’s a well-balanced ale with a delicate malty base and a crisp, hoppy bitterness. It has big stand-out at the bar with the iconic ‘Life of Brian’ lettering on the pumpclip. It will only be available in cask.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.2812	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
21417	Threedom	5404	Golden Ale / Blond Ale	4.2	\N	Threedom, new to our range for 2018, is a Triple-Hopped Pale Ale showcasing three Goliaths of the hop world. Travelling straight from the U.S.A, Summit, Galena and Citra hops are used to create a big, juicy pint with loads of flavour.A tropical aroma is followed by a bitter, juicy palate with notes of zesty, citrus fruit. It pours a gorgeous light straw colour and is perfect drinking for the - hopefully - hot month of August!Threedom celebrates the abundance of amazing hops that are currently being grown across the pond, working them into our unique, Yorkshire brewing methods.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.2812	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
21418	Progress	5404	Bitter Ale	4.0	\N	Progress is a rich and pure single hopped Anniversary Seasonal Ale with the classic Black Sheep dry and bitter finish 4.0% Alc.Specially crafted to celebrate the 20th anniversary of when we first brewed and delivered our beers in 1992. Expertly brewed using just full-flavoured English Progress hops, Maris Otter malted barley and pure Dales water. This is the purest expression of our tried and trusted brewing methods and our unique Yorkshire Square fermenting system which all takes place in our home town of Masham.Raise a glass and join us in celebration of 20 years of brewing with a pint of Progress!	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.2812	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
