21445	My Generation	5404	American Pale Ale (APA)	4.2	\N	My Generation - Session Pale Ale is the signature brew and will be the official beer of Record Store Day 2015, which takes place in April and is a nationwide celebration of vinyl records. A three month seasonal listing has been agreed with Mitchells & Butlers’ collection of Castle and Nicholson’s pubs from March, while there will also be a selective on-trade distribution.A programme of activity around festivals and other music-related events is being scheduled for throughout 2015.My Generation, which will initially be brewed as a cask ale, will be brewed in Masham, North Yorkshire, and distributed through Black Sheep Brewery. A 4.2% light straw coloured session pale ale, My Generation Pale Ale is brewed from an exciting blend of new world hops including Cascade, Galena, Magnum and Polaris, which gives a big, fresh aroma and a cracking bitter finish.A bottled version will follow, ahead of a planned 330ml can offering. Further brews will be released in due course.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.2812	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
