21522	Cinquantino	789	Golden Ale / Blond Ale	5.0	\N	Birra non pastorizzata prodotta artigianalmente che rifermenta in bottiglia. La nostra Cinquantino è leggera, ne berresti a ettolitri nelle giornate caldissime d’estate. Ha note fruttate e fresche ed una nota non amara data dal mais pregiato che ne conferisce un aroma unico. Come aperitivo, fuori in un bar o pub in una piazza gremita di gente con voglia di far festa. Al mare con pesce crudo, in montagna in una malga con stracchino fresco o ricotta. Si adatta a moltissimi piatti, dall’aperitivo a base di formaggi fino a piatti a base di carni bianche e pesce, insalatone. Può contenere lieviti sul fondo. Temperatura di servizio: 5 - 6° C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo pils friulano, mais Cinquantino friulano, luppolo friulano in amaro e fruttato in aroma, lievito ad alta fermentazione.Unpasteurized crafted beer, re-fermented in the bottle. Our Cinquantino is light, you still drink in hectoliters on summer hot days. Has fruity and fresh notes and a no bitterness provided by the precious corn gives it a unique aroma. As an aperitif, out at a bar or pub in a square crowded with people wants to party. By the sea with raw fish, in the mountains in a pasture with fresh soft cheese or cottage cheese. It adapts to many dishes, from aperitif with cheese up to dishes of white meat and fish, salads. May contain yeast on the bottom. Serving temperature 5 - 6° C. Ingredients: water, barley malt of Friuli pils, corn Cinquantino Friuli, hop bitterness and fruity in flavor Friuli, top-fermenting yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.2812	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
21524	Ambria	789	Amber Ale	5.5	\N	Birra non pastorizzata prodotta artigianalmente che rifermenta in bottiglia. La nostra birra stile Pale Ale ha note tostate e caramellate con un finale deciso, fresco e agrumato. Ideale ristoro dopo una giornata faticosa, offrila agli amici abbinata a crostini misti con salame e gorgonzola. L’aroma deciso e pieno ne fa una birra che bene si abbina a carni saporite a formaggi decisi e primi piatti corposi. Temperatura di servizio: 8 - 9° C. Ingredienti: acqua, malto pils e carapils friulani, fiocchi di frumento, luppoli friulani di stile americano, lievito ad alta fermentazione.Unpasteurized crafted beer, re-fermented in the bottle. Our Pale Ale has caramelized and toasted notes with a full-bodied, fresh and citrusy finish. Perfect refreshment after a hard day, offer it to friends combined with mixed crostini with salami and blue cheese. The strong aroma and full turns it into a beer that goes well with savory meats to strong cheeses and pasta dishes bodied. Serving temperature 8 - 9° C. Ingredients: water, pils and carapils malt Friuli, wheat flakes, hops Friuli American-style, top-fermenting yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.2812	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
21565	Simple Mosaic	5407	American Pale Ale (APA)	4.5	\N	Simple Mosaic is as the name suggests a ’simple’ or very straightforward ale brewed with a single hop - Mosaic. The original gravity of 11.6 Plato with 4.5 % ABV provides an easy, drinkable, session strength beer. Mosaic - one of the new wave hops from US (known as Citra on steroids) was selected to develop aroma rather than IBU, which at only 33 should make it enjoyable for most drinkers, and not just for hop heads. The yeast used is untypical for the style and adds extra intrigue to this refreshing pale ale. In short, this is a Simple Mosaic of different elements - just like the mosaic style label of the beer.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.450619	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
