23237	Juteux	5434	Sour / Wild Ale	8.3	\N	Juteux (French: 'Juicy') is a mixed-fermentation saison aged in French oak barrels with our house mixed culture of wild yeast and souring bacteria and aged with apricots. You might have had our Apricot Kisses (barrel-fermented saison w/ apricots), but in Juteux we added double the amount of apricots! So what you get is a  apricot-forward, tart, earthy, complex saison with hints of oak. 8.3% ABV (750ml corked & caged champagne-style bottles). 700 bottles.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.962611	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
