23779	Brewers Reserve S Jul	5439	Belgian Ale	6.8	\N	Brewers Reserve Lervigs Jul er et mørkt juleøl med undersmaker av plomme,rosin,kandis,ingefær og anis. Perfekt for å skape ekte lun julestemning ved bordet eller i ssofakroken.Spander ett glass på nissen også, så kommer han garantert tilbake neste år.  Brewers Reserve Lervigs Christmas is a dark Christmas beer with the flavors of plum, raisin, sugar candy, ginger and anise. Perfect for creating real warm Christmas spirit at the table or in ssofakroken. Save a glass of Santa Claus as well, so he guaranteed return next year.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.124448	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
23812	House Party	5439	American Pale Ale (APA)	4.0	\N	In Norvegia, i lunghi inverni e le brevi estati ci fanno sognare un'isola paradisiaca, ma di solito finiamo ad una festa in casa di amici. Così beviamo la House Party: un profilo di malto pulito e luppoli che rilasciano aromi di frutta tropicale.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.124448	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
