24287	Harvest Ipa - Ekuanot	5443	Belgian Ale	6.7	\N	As leaves start to fall and days get colder, we prepare our latest batch of Harvest IPA.For the uninitiated, Harvest IPA is our annually brewed Belgian IPA hybrid beer, pairing the distinctive flavours of our favourite house Saison yeast with the hops we feel complement it best and bring out different flavours with each edition. This year's edition is single-hopped with premium grade Ekuanot hops from North America. Bursting with tropical and papaya aroma, its juicy citrus and mango characteristics lend perfectly to the classic earthy funk of the Saison yeast. With a dry finish and lasting yeast character, it's the ideal beer for tranistioning from the fresh, fruity flavours of Summer into darker days and colder nights in Autumn.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
