24316	/ Pilot / Cromarty / Fallen Rhubarb & Citrus Sour	5443	Sour / Wild Ale	4.5	\N	At long last, the inaugural beer of our Seasons collaboration project is finally bottled, labelled, and ready to go. We might be just hitting the tail end of Spring with our Spring release, but what better way to say bye to Spring and hello to a hopefully bright, warm summer? A tart and refreshing beer brewed using local pale malt and wheat, then naturally acidified and infused with spring rhubarb and citrus peel. Brewed here in Tweedbank, alongside our friends from Cromarty, Pilot, and Fallen, to showcase the Scottish brewing industry in a unique way.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
