24997	Authentic Slo Wild Ale	5449	Sour / Wild Ale	6.0	\N	Our first in a series of blends utilizing our favorite barrels from the cellar that showcase our regions natural terrior.  These 18 barrels were carefully selected from over 400 barrels over a multiday blending session.  Funky and bright with notes of citrus and stone fruit, these flavors give way to hints of coconut and oak.  This blend still holds a great amount of mouthfeel but finishes very dry and tart begging for another sip.  We recommend grabbing a few of each batch to be able to compare vintages as they age.  Look for these blends to come out 3-4 times a year.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.466847	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
