25026	Gary	5449	Belgian Strong Ale	9.0	\N	Gary is a wine/beer hybrid made for our founder Tyler’s dad. He has always been a huge influence on the Libertine with his hard work ethic, craftsmanship, amazing musical talent/knowledge, and love of wine, (specifically chardonnay). We took our house saison and blended it with some amazing central coast oaked chardonnay from The Fableist winery on the aptly named Garey Vineyard. This hybrid is extremely drinkable at 9% abv with a touch of oak and great wine notes mixed with the dry funkiness of our house saison culture. Artwork is a portrait by the multi-talented Aubree, Gary’s 4 year old granddaughter.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.466847	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
