26044	Befana Chinata 2017	900	Belgian Strong Ale	8.5	\N	Birra natalizia alla “belga”, ha una grande bevibilità e una speziatura insolita e intrigante. In bocca è piena, ricca e molto elegante, finisce amara e speziata, con note agrumate e medicinali. Il colore è dorato carico con riflessi aranciati, al naso spiccano note fruttate, agrumate e balsamiche, donate dalla corteccia di china e dai luppoli americani e australiani. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, fiocchi d’avena, zucchero di canna, luppolo, corteccia di China e lievito. Christmas beer, 'Belgian'; has a great drinkability and an unusual and intriguing spice. In the mouth it is full, rich and very elegant, it ends bitter and spicy, with citrus and medicinal notes. The color is golden, with orange reflections, with fruity, citrus and balsamic notes on the nose, donated by bark of China and American and Australian hops. Ingredients: water, barley malt, oat flakes, brown sugar, hops, bark of China and yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.822564	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
26068	Rad Red Amber Ale	5462	Amber Ale	5.6	\N	American Amber Ale combines the timelessness of European ales as well as the innovativeness of American breweries, making it a uniquely new world take on a classic style. Our Rad Red Amber Ale’s extra hop kick takes this tradition of innovation a step further. Its solid hop presence, which comes from 100% American hops, is balanced by crunchy Caramel Malt, giving it a perfect amber color and chewy malt character. We kept the rest simple, using only Upland’s own yeast ale blend and pure southern Indiana water for this drinkable yet refreshingly radical brew.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.985308	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
