27340	Terroir Project Chinook Wet Hop Pale Ale (Vqh Farms)	5475	American Pale Ale (APA)	5.4	\N	The morning of September 6th, 2016, the Sawdust City brew team travelled to VQH Farms in Tillsonburg, Ontario Through the early hours we helped with the harvest of their Row G Chinook hops. But 10am, 140 lbs of hops were picked, bagged and ready for the 309 km back to the brewery. But 2pm the hops were in the brew kettle. This Wet Hop pale ale is the result. Crafted with a nice, bready malt bill to balance the loads of fresh, aromatic, whole cone hops bursting with notes of bright citrus fruit. Join us for our Terroir Project and taste the unique flavours of our local Ontario hop farms.Listed as Chinook Tillsonburg at The Only Cafe event November 2016..	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.324333	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
27343	I Swear Sugar Pants It Was Your Idea Chocolate Oatmeal Brown Ale	5475	Brown Ale	5.3	\N	Chocolate Oatmeal Brown ale.Pouring a robust and enticing brown, this malt-forward ale leads with delicate aromas of chocolate and roasted malt. The flavour is rich and full-loaded with roasted malt, cocoa, nuts and doughy baked bread. A great “pint” with a silky smooth body, best enjoyed in the company of another one.Ideas can come from anywhere. Sometimes they can come to you in a moment of clarity. Sometimes they can come to you in your sleep. Other times they can come to you from someone else. This beer was brewed to honour those wonderful people in our lives that share their ideas and are a constant source of inspiration. With large portions of flaked oats this hearty ale has a full mouthfeel and a robust malt-forward body. Throw in some delicious sweet, rum-like flavours from the demerara sugar and chocolate aromas from a dose of cocoa husks, this is the perfect ale to share and discuss ideas with those special people in our lives.WATER pure Muskoka waterBARLEY/MALT Maris Otter, Flaked Oats, Chocolate Malt, Special W, Coffee Malt, Victory, Demerara SugarHOPS Magnum, CascadeYEAST California aleOTHER Chocolate Husks	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:49.324333	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
