30049	Illuminating The Path	5502	American Strong Ale	10.0	\N	This ale is brewed with spices & fruit and aged in Pinot Noir wine barrels.  This beer was created by Wayne Wambles from Cigar City and the new brewmaster at Ecliptic John Harris.  This beer connects Oregon and Florida using native Rose Hips, Marionberries from Oregon and Hibiscus and acai berries from Florida.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:50.302287	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
30050	Campeador - Rurik	5502	American Strong Ale	11.3	\N	Rurik: the founder of the dynasty that bears his name which ruled Kievan Rus and later Muscovy until the 16th century. This land would later spawn the Muscovy Trading Company and become a base of trade between Russia and Britain. Two styles of beer comprise this blend, old ale and imperial stout. Both are of British origin with the later made famous by its exportation to the Russian Court. Rurik is the second beer in the Campeador series, a barrel-aged collaboration between Knightly Spirits and Cigar City Brewing. Limited release of 204 bottles.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:50.302287	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
30058	Black Whole	5502	American Strong Ale	8.0	\N	Black Whole is a tribute to El Chupa Cobras, a math indie band from Montgomery, Alabama.  This effort came about from our realization that craft beer and indie music have something in common… they both share about the same amount of their respectful markets and challenge the consumer.  Wayne Wambles, our head brewer, and Kenny Johnson, the front man from El Chupa Cobras, played in indie bands together many years ago and this tribute is for all indie music fans and craft beer lovers. Black Whole is a multidimensional ale that takes many twists and turns similar to our daily lives.  It has a big chocolate expression with moderate caramel notes, complex toasted to biscuit notes and hints of clove and black licorice.  Don your chocolate mask and discover the meaning of life as you sip this complex, dark beer.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:50.302287	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
30079	CastagnAle	1	Chestnut Ale	6.0	30	Birra aromatizzata con castagne, vincitrice nella sua categoria	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	Marrone castagna	2025-07-22 22:52:20.734993	t	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551538827-9c037cb4f32d?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
447	Sabotage Porter	132	Porter	5.9	\N	Sabotage Porter – это крепкий портер в своей американской интерпретации, с умеренно выраженным солодовым вкусом, легким жженым запахом и кофейным послевкусием.Говоря об американской интерпретации, мы не ограничиваемся только США, а также обращаемся к Южной Америке, а точнее к Бразилии. Ведь именно оттуда, из региона Суль-де-Минас были привезены кофейные зерна типа Бразилия Сантос, которые специально обжарили наши друзья из кофейный кооператив «Чёрный». Мы добавили зерна грубого помола в самом конце кипячения, чтобы они только подчеркнули кофейные тона жженых солодов, но не перебили их.Саботаж – это логическое продолжение заговора. То, что происходит на корабле, когда морякам запрещают выходить на берег дабы с головой окунуться в загул около-портовой жизни.Дизайн для портера исполнил наш друг Арсений из студии IRON TUSK Tattoo, в классической стилистике Моряка Джерри.Robust Porter with moderate malt flavor and light coffee aftertaste. Brewed with coffee Brazilia Santos made for this brew by coffee house Cooperative Cherniy.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-21 23:16:18.027629	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
1123	Monsoon Porter	5190	Porter	4.2	\N	From Black Isle Facebook ’’Fancy trying out our latest collaboration beer? Head down to The Stockbridge Tap in Edinburgh to try out our new Monsoon Porter. Recently Black Isle Brewery and the award winning Artisan Roast teamed up to create Monsoon Porter (4.2%). Brewed with dark roasted malts for a rich, medium dry flavour this dark beauty is a ruby to black coloured beer that will surely tantalise your taste buds.The Monsoon Malabar Red Bourbon coffee, selected and supplied Artisan Roast, is full of warming spice fresh from Southern India with hints of cinnamon and cracked pepper. To achieve its full-bodied dusky flavour, the coffee crop is monsooned, a process which is unique to India. Once harvested, the coffee crop is laid out on racks after the monsoon rains to dry. During this process the moist monsoon winds circulate around the crops turning the green coffee a rich golden yellow colour and absorbing the earthy flavours of the soil, which adds to its pleasantly piquant taste.Over time this method replicates the effect that long sea voyages once had on beans when they were shipped over 200 years ago from India, round Cape Horn and northwards through the Atlantic to thirsty Georgian coffee drinkers. The earthy, spicy, malty, chocolaty flavours of the Monsoon Malabar combine perfectly with the velvety bittersweet taste of the Porter to create this special limited edition beer.Be one of the first beer connoisseurs to try Monsoon Porter by visiting The Stockbridge Tap. ’’	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-21 23:20:59.092245	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
2490	Game Of Thrones Royal Reserve #3 - Mother Of Dragons	196	Porter	6.6	\N	Smoked Porter & Kriek Ale Blend A beer for Daenerys. A blend of delicately smoked porter and tart cherry kriek. Brewed for those who nurture dragons. As the war for the Seven Kingdoms rages to a climax, Ommegang presents the 'Royal Reserve Collection.' This collection of four exclusive and extremely limited release ales, available in 2018, is brewed as an homage to the four epic figures still standing against the annihilation of mankind. 'Mother of Dragons' -- a beer for Daenerys -- is a richly complex blend of smoked porter and Belgian kriek. It pours a deep ruby-brown with alluring aromas of tart cherry, dark roast and hints of smoke. 'Mother of Dragons' is the third release in our Royal Reserve Collection. These are the beers representing what a court brewer would offer a noble lord or lady: perfect balance and pure drinking pleasure. Brewed and blended for a leader who takes what is hers with fire and blood, Mother of Dragons is a blend of a smoked porter and a Belgian kriek, representing the smoke and fire that Daenerys has unleashed on her opponents. “Mother of Dragons represents in beer one of our favorite characters from Game of Thrones. Daenerys’s ascent from obscurity has been one of the most inspiring storylines of the show, and we’re thrilled to release a blend that embodies the character traits that have underpinned that rise,” said Doug Campbell, Brewery Ommegang president. Mother of Dragons pours a deep ruby-tinted mahogany with a creamy tan head. Aromas of chocolate covered cherries intertwine with subtle smoke and roasted malt. The flavor is rich with tart cherry up front leading to a center palate of semi-sweet chocolate then resolving to subtle smoke and mild sweetness. The mouthfeel is luxuriously creamy and full, and the finish is semi-dry with lingering notes of smoke and cherry sweetness.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.361767	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
3394	Zimnaya Melankholiya (Winter Melancholy)	233	Baltic Porter	10.3	\N	'Winter Melancholy'A New Year’s Eve version of warmly recognized Melancholy, our Imperial Baltic Porter. Smooth touch of Kenyan coffee and bourbon vanilla turn the beer from egocentric and depressive to meditative and reflexive as we all become on the first days of the New Year.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:40.732745	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
4439	Royal Porter	5226	Imperial Porter	10.0	\N	Cerveza maltosa, oscura y amable. De textura cremosa y aterciopelada con sabores a cacao y regaliz. Hecha para deleitar.Nuestra cerveza de invierno. La selección de lúpulos especiados y maltas caramelo logran reproducir los matices del cacao más noble.De color negro intenso con corona plena de color hueso. Aroma a torrefactos ligeros con notas de toffe y ésteres frutales. Su paso en boca es sedoso y agradable. Sabor amable a cacao y caramelo de regaliz con detalles de miel y especias.MALTY, DARK AND AMIABLE BEER. CREAMY AND VELVETY IN TEXTURE, WITH COCOA AND LIQUORICE FLAVOURS.OUR WINTER BEER. THE SELECTION OF SPICY HOPS AND CARAMEL MALTS REPRODUCES THE NUANCES OF THE NOBLEST COCOA.INTENSE BLACK COLOUR WITH A BONE-COLOURED, FULL CROWN. LIGHT ROASTED AROMA WITH NOTES OF TOFFEE AND FRUIT ESTERS. ITS MOUTHFEEL IS SILKY AND PLEASANT. AMIABLE TASTE OF COCOA AND LIQUORICE CANDY WITH HONEY AND SPICE DETAILS.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.111027	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
