5569	Saracena	289	Porter	5.0	\N	Degna di un principe. Birra speciale ad alta fermentazione. Colore marrone intenso. Da Ibn Sawada fino a Turgus Reis i Saraceni hanno sempre saccheggiato le nostre coste, ora invece ci stanno regalando la cannella e la noce moscata per rendere speciale questa birra dal sapore cioccolattoso con un finale dolce. Provala con un brasato o per finire un pasto col cioccolato! Temperatura di servizio 10° C. Presenta un leggero deposito di lievito sul fondo che testimonia l’artigianalità della bevanda. Ingredienti: acqua, malto d’orzo, farro (3%), luppolo, cannella (0,01%), noce moscata (0,01%), lievito.Fit for a prince. Special high fermentation beer. Rich brown color. Ibn Sawada until Turgus Reis Saracens have always plundered our coasts, but now they are giving the cinnamon and nutmeg to make this special beer tasting Chocolate with a sweet finish. Try it with a braised or to finish a meal with the chocolate! Serving temperature 10° C. It has a slight deposit of yeast on the bottom that testifies the craftsmanship of the drink. Ingredients: water, barley malt, farro (3%), hops, cinnamon (0.01%), nutmeg (0.01%), yeast.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.661028	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
6235	Pot & Kettle	5242	Porter	7.5	\N	Our signature porter, brewed with oats, has a soft, velvety mouthfeel with layers of chocolate and roasted malt on the palate. The ominously black appearance belies this porter’s approachability; Pot & Kettle is satisfyingly smooth and nourishing, but never lumbering or heavy. While not sweet, dark fruit notes, such as cherries, dates, and raisins, reveal themselves as the beer warms.ABV: 7.5%MALT: American 2-row, Rolled Oats, Pale Chocolate, Black (Patent), Carafa III, Caramunich, C-120, C-80HOPS: ColumbusLast canned on Dec 10, 2016Please note, if yours had COFFEE in it, this is not the correct entry.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:41.839507	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
7633	Molo	383	Porter	5.5	\N	La Molo è una Porter in Stile Londinese, prodotta con Malti tostati e torrefatti.Profumo forte di tostatura, schiuma compatta e fine, bassa gasatura.In bocca note di caffè e liquirizia lasciano il posto ad un amaro di malto persistente.Per nostra definizione una birra da 'Tabacco', trova posto però anche nell’abbinamento con puree di frutta, biscotti secchi, anche aromatizzati e creme pasticcere.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:42.430466	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
