10316	Black Christmas	460	Imperial Porter	10.5	\N	La Black Christmas è una imperial porter in cui l'alcolicità è ben nascosta da un'adeguata attenuazione e un finale decisamente "dry". Niente stucchevoli ricordi di caramello, miele o toffee, ma raffinate note torrefatte di caffè d'orzo, radice di liquirizia e mallo di noce. Ci siamo divertiti ad impreziosirla con una speziatura golosa e consona alle festività, profumandola con cioccolato, vaniglia e arancia dolce... la lunga shelf life ne farà un'aggiunta perfetta per la vostra cantina di invecchiamento.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.383763	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
10907	Sheltered Spirit	5284	Imperial Porter	14.0	\N	We brewed this beer in 2016 with the sole intention of ageing it in bourbon barrels. The inspiration was all about tamarind - an ingredient revered for the sweet and sour depth it can add to dishes and drinks, particularly popular in the tropics. It didn’t disappoint - offering an amazing fruity aroma almost immediately. In folklore, tamarind trees are said to harbour ghosts, and for that reason are often found on the outskirts of villages. Our Sheltered Spirit has serenely matured into something very special. Allergens: Contains Malted Barley, Wheat, Rye	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.562328	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
11036	/ Blank Slate Cincy 3-Way Porter	5286	Porter	7.0	\N	Cincy 3-Way Porter was brewed in collaboration with Blank Slate Brewing Company of Cincinnati, Ohio at the original Oskar Blues Grill & Brew in Lyons, Colorado. The brewers spiced barley with cumin, coriander, allspice and cinnamon, and then smoked it.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:43.562328	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1569529465841-dfecdab7503b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
