22744	Les Vergers De La Colline Rose	821	Sidro	6.5	\N	NOTE- This is a still rosé cider. Available in 750 ml clear wine bottles in SAQ and at the cidery only. A pretty raspberry color, a nose offering cherry and blackberry fragrances, but also passing on a floral note of rose. As for taste, a pleasant and very well balanced acidity that develops into a fresh bouquet of cranberries, strawberries and currants. Rose’s superb robe results from our own unique process: harvested by hand, perfectly ripe apples are pressed and then, undergo maceration with apple skins, giving it this appetizing color. Light in alcohol, Rose will charm your senses in many ways, while undoubtedly spicing up blissful hot summer afternoons with friends. It can fly solo but will accompany apple-cheddar crepe or some tasty tapas quite well.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.794426	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
