22755	Les Vergers De La Colline Cuivré	821	Sidro	10.0	\N	Its glittering golden robe exudes dynamic and winey aromas with caramel and dried figs notes. Citrus fruits such as pink grapefruit and lime plus a hint of fruity green grapes convey a well-balanced acidity and fullness in the mouth. A persistent and elegant finish with reminiscence of honey and green olive. Cryoconcentration uses natural cold to concentrate sugars in the must before fermentation and gives this product its unique organoleptic signature! Enjoy like a semi-dry white. A pure delight with fresh oysters, white fish such as fresh cod or tilapia, a tender grilled pork filet or yet, an excellent goat cheese.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:47.794426	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
