23833	Vellagret Julebrygg	5439	Dunkler Bock	6.5	\N	[Norwegian]: For smakens skyld lagres dette julebrygget i hele 14 måneder i gjæringstankene før det tappes på flaske. Dette resulterer i rike røykaromaer i anslaget, god fylde, bløtt skum, krydder i midten og svake bittertoner i finishen. [English]: For the sake of flavour this Christmas Brew is lagered for as much as 14 months in the fermenting tanks before it is bottled. This results in rich smoke aromas in the first touch, rich mouthfeel, soft head, spices in the middle and faint bittering tones in the finish.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.124448	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
