24334	/ Beer 52 Mambo Jambo	5443	Fruit Beer	5.0	\N	A collaboration with Beer 52.Inspired by homemade rhubarb crumble, we bring you Mambo Jambo a rhubarb and cascade saison. A real rhubarb rollercoaster! A classic saison aroma bursting with Belgian characteristic and hints of Cola Cubes and Fruit Salad sweets. Tart on the palate, a slight initial sharpness instantly gives way to a rich cereal flavour, nectarine and a hint of freshly cut grass. A dry, tart and satisfying finish sees the fresh rhubarb flavour build with every mouthful. Effortlessly enjoyable, dangerously drinkable, Mambo Jambo is the perfect summer refresher.To take you in the sun to promised lands… it’s the time of the saison.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
