24395	Freestyle #30	5444	Saison	8.0	\N	Birthday ale brewed with Belgian candi sugar, mixed culture fermentation, aged on Maine cedar.At Oxbow we strive to keep you on your toes.  Skipping from Freestyle 13 to 30 has probably turned a few heads...We brewed Freestyle 30 on Tim’s 30th birthday.  Two good friends of ours --  Sam Fitz (Beer Director at the Meridian Pint and Smoke and Barrel) and Greg Jasgur (Beer Director at Pizzeria Paradiso) -- collaborated with us on this beer.  They trekked up from Washington DC in a snowstorm to hang out, brew, and help make this complex beer come to life.Freestyle #30 is tart and malty, but dry.  We find hints of black pepper, earth, leather, funk, tropical fruit, and coniferous forest.      (March 2013)	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.295453	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
