25402	Strongman	5454	Barley Wine	11.5	\N	Our sumptuous golden Barley Wine ‘Strongman’ hails from the same brew as our annual release IIIPA ‘Un-Human Cannonball’ . Using just our house pale Golden Promise malt the beer is then judiciously hopped with Centennial, Citra and CTZ whole hops in our hop back. However instead of assaulting the beer with dry-hops we then carefully age it in freshly emptied Amontillado Sherry casks until its ready to take the stage. The resulting beer is golden in colour with a rich pungent aroma and full palate, which gives way to rich fruit and brisk nutty flavours. Best drunk slightly cold a dry yet balanced finish delights the taste buds while a warming finish brings the curtains down…	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25403	Circus Of Sour	5454	Berliner Weisse	3.5	\N	A contemporary take on the traditional sour wheat style from the German capital. Pilsner and Wheat malt are soured overnight in the kettle before being part fermented with Brettanomyces Bruxellensis. Tart, sour and refreshing with a spritzy carbonation and the added complexity of ‘Brett’ appearing as the beer ages…. as they say in these parts “it’ll make your teeth laugh”	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25407	Acrobat	5454	Saison	6.2	\N	Apricot & tarragon saison.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25408	Sour Passion	5454	Grodziskie/Gose/Lichtenhainer	4.7	\N	Inspired by our World Beer Cup winning gose Salty Kiss but with a sour and tropical twist. The beer has added Passion Fruit, Mango, Lime and Lemon and as with Salty Kiss, we dosed with salt to taste as is traditional in a gose. The resulting beer is juicy and refreshing with a nice rounded drinkability. If you imagine a tropical fruit punch crossed with a lemonade/ginger beer you wouldn’t be far off. Hopefully it should be just what’s needed to combat the miserable winter weather.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25417	The Upside Down	5454	Blanche	6.0	\N	Constructed atop Magic Rock’s signature Golden Promise malt bill and a hefty dose of wheat, rye and oats, this kettle-soured, tropical fruit-witbier takes advantage of several complex brewing techniques and flavours to create a truly beguiling beer. Coriander and turmeric were added into the boil to add zestiness, warming spice and a rich colour, while Citra and Equinox hops added tropical flavours to the body of the beer. ‘BrettTrois’ was then used to wholly ferment the brew and create tartness with delicate hints of mango and pineapple. Finally mango and passionfruit juice were added alongside a bold dry-hopping to create a burst of juicy aromas and flavours.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25421	Salty Margarita	5454	Grodziskie/Gose/Lichtenhainer	4.1	\N	Tequila barrel aged version – Originally brewed as a collaboration with Kissmeyer Beer, this is our take on a traditional German style Gose, flavoured with fruit, sea buckthorn and sea salt. Tart, lightly sour, fruity and refreshing with a defined saltiness makes this beer an excellent accompaniment to food.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25423	Bellini Vice	5454	Berliner Weisse	4.5	\N	The first of this series is a Raspberry & Peach Berliner Weisse mimicking the classic Bellini cocktail. It has a delicate and clean body, a beautiful peachy pink/orange colour from the fruit additions, bright carbonation and a refreshing sour tang.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25426	Pith Head	5454	Fruit Beer	4.5	\N	A dry and pithy interpretation of the popular German hybrid beer style ‘Radler’. brewed especially for the 2014 Borefts Beer Festival. We started with a simple pale malt bill and whole hop Sorachi Ace for a lemony hoppy hit. We then peeled and juiced 50Kgs of fresh lemons and limes and added them in the hopback. Finally we fermented with French Saison yeast & added even more Lemon and Lime for tons of lip smacking citrus character and dry & spicy finish. Get on the Pith.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
25427	Piña Mojito Vice	5454	Berliner Weisse	5.5	\N	The next beer in our cocktail inspired ‘Vice’ series is a pineapple, lime and mint Berliner Weiss in collaboration with Stillwater Artisanal. Kettle soured and then flavoured with multiple doses of pineapple and lime throughout the brew along with over 10kg of fresh mint leaves. Tropically aromatic, with a citrus tang and super refreshing mint finish.	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
