25469	Barefoot	5455	Saison	4.7	\N	Grapefruit Saison. We at Amundsen believe that summer is not a season, but a state of mind. To help get you into that summer state of minde we have concocted a supremely refreshing libation, showering warm rays of sunshine upon your pallet. Beerfoot is a saison made with fresh grapefruit juice and citrus forward American hops. The result is a beer that will turn your snow boots into flip flos or your flip flops into bare feet. Beerfoot Saison pairs best with eggs benedict after a night of skinny dipping in the Oslofjord.MALT: Pilsner, WheatHOPS: Magnum - MandarinaYEAST: French Saison	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1608270586620-248524c67de9?w=200&h=200&fit=crop	\N	2025-07-22 05:54:48.643807	f	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80	https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80
